c, mặt hàng đang ghép là Bánh xích xe cước, bánh xích xe xúc lật, bánh xích xe đào xe ủi đất, khi ghép luôn luôn đảm bảo hàng hóa nguyên vẹn từ lúc nhận cho đến lúc giao hàng tận tay.</p></div><div id=\\\"attachment_5081\\\" class=\\\"wp-caption alignnone\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 5px 20px 20px 0px; background: rgb(247, 247, 247); border: 1px solid rgb(230, 230, 230); max-width: 100%; padding: 10px; text-align: center; color: rgb(200, 50, 43); font-family: &quot;\\\\&quot;roboto\\\\&quot;, helvetica, arial&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; width: 1930px;\\\"><img aria-describedby=\\\"caption-attachment-5081\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" loading=\\\"lazy\\\" class=\\\"size-full wp-image-5081\\\" src=\\\"https://conruabien.vn/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/Nhan-ghep-hang-nho-le-di-Phu-Quoc-thoi-gian-nhanh-90-scaled.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"Nhan ghep hang nho le di Phu Quoc thoi gian nhanh 90 scaled\\\" width=\\\"1920\\\" height=\\\"2560\\\" srcset=\\\"https://conruabien.vn/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/Nhan-ghep-hang-nho-le-di-Phu-Quoc-thoi-gian-nhanh-90-scaled.jpg 1920w, https://conruabien.vn/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/Nhan-ghep-hang-nho-le-di-Phu-Quoc-thoi-gian-nhanh-90-768x1024.jpg 768w, https://conruabien.vn/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/Nhan-ghep-hang-nho-le-di-Phu-Quoc-thoi-gian-nhanh-90-1152x1536.jpg 1152w, https://conruabien.vn/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/Nhan-ghep-hang-nho-le-di-Phu-Quoc-thoi-gian-nhanh-90-1536x2048.jpg 1536w\\\" sizes=\\\"(max-width: 1920px) 100vw, 1920px\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; height: auto; max-width: 100%; border: 0px none; vertical-align: middle; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; wi