 chuyển hàng xe điện đi Phú Quốc; Trong ảnh là cảnh xe tải và xe cẩu đang trong quá trình giao nhận xe điện tại Gành Dầu Phú Quốc, xe điện đi Phú Quốc được giao nhận cho dự án Grand World Phú Quốc)</p></div><div id=\\\"attachment_4261\\\" class=\\\"wp-caption alignnone\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 5px 20px 20px 0px; background: rgb(247, 247, 247); border: 1px solid rgb(230, 230, 230); max-width: 100%; padding: 10px; text-align: center; color: rgb(200, 50, 43); font-family: &quot;\\\\&quot;roboto\\\\&quot;, helvetica, arial&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; width: 2410px;\\\"><img aria-describedby=\\\"caption-attachment-4261\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" loading=\\\"lazy\\\" class=\\\"size-full wp-image-4261\\\" src=\\\"https://conruabien.vn/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/Chanh-xe-van-chuyen-hang-hoa-tu-sai-gon-di-phu-quoc-2022-05-25-16.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"Chanh xe van chuyen hang hoa tu sai gon di phu quoc 2022 05 25 16\\\" width=\\\"2400\\\" height=\\\"1800\\\" srcset=\\\"https://conruabien.vn/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/Chanh-xe-van-chuyen-hang-hoa-tu-sai-gon-di-phu-quoc-2022-05-25-16.jpg 2400w, https://conruabien.vn/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/Chanh-xe-van-chuyen-hang-hoa-tu-sai-gon-di-phu-quoc-2022-05-25-16-768x576.jpg 768w, https://conruabien.vn/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/Chanh-xe-van-chuyen-hang-hoa-tu-sai-gon-di-phu-quoc-2022-05-25-16-1536x1152.jpg 1536w, https://conruabien.vn/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/Chanh-xe-van-chuyen-hang-hoa-tu-sai-gon-di-phu-quoc-2022-05-25-16-2048x1536.jpg 2048w\\\" sizes=\\\"(max-width: 2400px) 100vw, 2400px\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; height: auto; max-width: 100%; b