ox; font-weight: bold;\\\">Vận chuyển ghép hàng từ Cảng Cát Lái đi Phú Quốc</strong><span>&nbsp;</span>nói riêng và vận tải hàng hóa nói chung tối ưu.</span></p><p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; color: rgb(200, 50, 43); font-family: &quot;\\\\&quot;roboto\\\\&quot;, helvetica, arial&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; text-align: right;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\\"><strong style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold;\\\"><em style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">(Nguồn:<span>&nbsp;</span></em></strong><a href=\\\"https://www.conruabien.vn/\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-decoration: none;\\\"><strong style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold;\\\"><em style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">www.conruabien.vn</em></strong></a><strong style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold;\\\"><em style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\"><span>&nbsp;</span>– Chành xe Phú Quốc –<span>&nbsp;</span></em></strong><strong style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold;\\\"><em style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">0945000006</em></strong><strong style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold;\\\"><em style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">)</em></strong></span></p>\"','2024-05-21 02:01:52','/tin-tuc/van-chuyen-ghep-hang-tu-cang-cat-lai-di-phu-quoc-0945000006',NULL,0,5,NULL,NULL,NULL);
