aption alignnone\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 5px 20px 20px 0px; background: rgb(247, 247, 247); border: 1px solid rgb(230, 230, 230); max-width: 100%; padding: 10px; text-align: center; color: rgb(200, 50, 43); font-family: &quot;\\\\&quot;roboto\\\\&quot;, helvetica, arial&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; width: 2410px;\\\"><img aria-describedby=\\\"caption-attachment-3343\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" loading=\\\"lazy\\\" class=\\\"size-full wp-image-3343\\\" src=\\\"https://conruabien.vn/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Cho-thue-xa-lan-ha-mom-cho-xe-tai-cho-xe-dau-keo-container-di-Phu-Quoc-Hon-Thom-Nam-Du-12.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"Cho thue xa lan ha mom cho xe tai cho xe dau keo container di Phu Quoc Hon Thom Nam Du 12\\\" width=\\\"2400\\\" height=\\\"1352\\\" srcset=\\\"https://conruabien.vn/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Cho-thue-xa-lan-ha-mom-cho-xe-tai-cho-xe-dau-keo-container-di-Phu-Quoc-Hon-Thom-Nam-Du-12.jpg 2400w, https://conruabien.vn/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Cho-thue-xa-lan-ha-mom-cho-xe-tai-cho-xe-dau-keo-container-di-Phu-Quoc-Hon-Thom-Nam-Du-12-768x433.jpg 768w, https://conruabien.vn/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Cho-thue-xa-lan-ha-mom-cho-xe-tai-cho-xe-dau-keo-container-di-Phu-Quoc-Hon-Thom-Nam-Du-12-1536x865.jpg 1536w, https://conruabien.vn/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Cho-thue-xa-lan-ha-mom-cho-xe-tai-cho-xe-dau-keo-container-di-Phu-Quoc-Hon-Thom-Nam-Du-12-2048x1154.jpg 2048w\\\" sizes=\\\"(max-width: 2400px) 100vw, 2400px\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; height: auto; max-width: 100%; border: 0px none; vertical-align: middle; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; width: auto;\\\"><p id=\\\"caption-attachment-3343\\\" class=\\\"wp-caption-text\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; font-size: 11px; line-height: 17px; padding: 5px;\\\">Con Rùa Biển là Chành xe Hà Nội Sài Gòn Phú Quốc chạy chuyên tuyến, có lịch xe chạy cố định hằng ngày, nhận vận chuyển hàng lẻ đi ghép hoặc hàng bao xe. Đặc biệt còn cung cấp dịch vụ vận tải hàng hóa bằng đường thủy theo hình thức: cho thuê xà lan, cho thuê tàu biển, cho thuê phà đi biển, cho thuê xà lan há mòm chở xe tải, xe đầu kéo container từ đất liền đi Đảo Phú Quốc, Đảo Hòn Thơm, Đảo Nam Du, Đảo Thổ Châu, Đảo Hòn Trẻ, Đảo Hòn Sơn.</p></div><div id=\\\"attachment_3340\\\" class=\\\"wp-caption alignnone\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 5px 20px 20px 0px; background: rgb(247, 247, 247); border: 1px solid rgb(230, 230, 230); max-width: 100%; padding: 10px; text-align: center; color: rgb(200, 50, 43); font-family: &quot;\\\\&quot;roboto\\\\&quot;, helvetica, arial&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; width: 2410px;\\\"><img aria-describedby=\\\"caption-attachment-3340\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" loading=\\\"lazy\\\" class=\\\"size-full wp-image-3340\\\" src=\\\"https://conruabien.vn/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Cho-thue-xa-lan-ha-mom-cho-xe-tai-cho-xe-dau-keo-container-di-Phu-Quoc-Hon-Thom-Nam-Du-9.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"Cho thue xa lan ha mom cho xe tai cho xe dau keo container di Phu Quoc Hon Thom Nam Du 9\\\" width=\\\"2400\\\" height=\\\"1468\\\" srcset=\\\"https://conruabien.vn/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Cho-thue-xa-lan-ha-mom-cho-xe-tai-cho-xe-dau-keo-container-di-Phu-Quoc-Hon-Thom-Nam-Du-9.jpg 2400w, https://conruabien.vn/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Cho-thue-xa-lan-h