box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; color: rgb(200, 50, 43); font-family: &quot;\\\\&quot;roboto\\\\&quot;, helvetica, arial&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; text-align: justify;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\\"><em style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">Đơn vị vận tải hàng hóa<span>&nbsp;</span><strong style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold;\\\">cho thuê xe chở hàng Thang Máy đi Phú Quốc</strong><span>&nbsp;</span>giá rẻ ở đâu?</em></span></p><p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; color: rgb(200, 50, 43); font-family: &quot;\\\\&quot;roboto\\\\&quot;, helvetica, arial&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; text-align: justify;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\\"><em style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">Làm thế nào để bản thân tự tính giá cước phí<span>&nbsp;</span><strong style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold;\\\">Vận chuyển hàng Thang máy đi Phú Quốc</strong></em></span></p><p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; color: rgb(200, 50, 43); font-family: &quot;\\\\&quot;roboto\\\\&quot;, helvetica, arial&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant