ainer hàng nhập từ Cảng Cát Lái HCM đi Phú Quốc, và được xe cẩu 20 tấn, rút kiện máy giặt sấy công nghiệp từ container đưa vào cửa nhà chứa máy giặt, sau đó bắt đầu di chuyện kiện máy vào vị trí để.)</p></div><div id=\\\"attachment_3386\\\" class=\\\"wp-caption alignnone\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 5px 20px 20px 0px; background: rgb(247, 247, 247); border: 1px solid rgb(230, 230, 230); max-width: 100%; padding: 10px; text-align: center; color: rgb(200, 50, 43); font-family: &quot;\\\\&quot;roboto\\\\&quot;, helvetica, arial&quot;, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; width: 2410px; font-size: 14px;\\\"><img aria-describedby=\\\"caption-attachment-3386\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" loading=\\\"lazy\\\" class=\\\"size-full wp-image-3386\\\" src=\\\"https://conruabien.vn/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Du-an-Van-chuyen-May-Giat-Say-Cong-Nghiep-di-Phu-Quoc-23.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"Du an Van chuyen May Giat Say Cong Nghiep di Phu Quoc 23\\\" width=\\\"2400\\\" height=\\\"1350\\\" srcset=\\\"https://conruabien.vn/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Du-an-Van-chuyen-May-Giat-Say-Cong-Nghiep-di-Phu-Quoc-23.jpg 2400w, https://conruabien.vn/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Du-an-Van-chuyen-May-Giat-Say-Cong-Nghiep-di-Phu-Quoc-23-768x432.jpg 768w, https://conruabien.vn/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Du-an-Van-chuyen-May-Giat-Say-Cong-Nghiep-di-Phu-Quoc-23-1536x864.jpg 1536w, https://conruabien.vn/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Du-an-Van-chuyen-May-Giat-Say-Cong-Nghiep-di-Phu-Quoc-23-2048x1152.jpg 2048w\\\" sizes=\\\"(max-width: 2400px) 100vw, 2400px\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; height: auto; max-width: 100%; border: 0px none; vertical-align: middle; margin: 0px;