\" style=\\\"font-size: 15px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; margin: 0px 0px 0px 48px; text-align: justify; text-indent: -24px; line-height: normal; background: white;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 13px; font-family: Symbol;\\\"><span>¾<span style=\\\"font: 9px &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\\n            </span></span></span><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 17px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; color: black;\\\">Nhận\\n        thông tin yêu cầu<span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">&nbsp;</span><strong>vận chuyển\\n            hàng hóa</strong>&nbsp;</span>của Quý khách hàng về việc vận chuyển hàng hóa đi các\\n    tỉnh, TP lớn nên<span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">&nbsp;</span><strong>Con Rùa Biển</strong>&nbsp;đã\\n    cung cấp các dịch vụ vận tải:</p>\\n\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 15px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; margin: 0px 0px 0px 96px; text-align: justify; text-indent: -24px; line-height: normal; background: white;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 13px; font-family: &quot;Courier New&quot;;\\\"><span>o<span style=\\\"font: 9px &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><strong><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 17px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; color: black;\\\">Dịch vụ vận chuyển hàng hóa đường bộ Bắc\\n            Nam</span></strong></p>\\n\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 15px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; margin: 0px 0px 0px 96px; text-align: justify; text-indent: -24px; line-height: normal; background: white;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 13px; font-family: &quot;Courier New&quot;;\\\"><span>o<span style=\\\"font: 9px &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><strong><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 17px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; color: black;\\\">Dịch vụ cho thuê xe tải đi Phú Quốc</span></strong></p>\\n\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 15px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; margin: 0px 0px 0px 96px; text-align: justify; text-indent: -24px; line-height: normal; background: white;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 13px; font-family: &quot;Courier New&quot;;\\\"><span>o<span style=\\\"font: 9px &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><strong><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 17px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; color: black;\\\">Dịch vụ cho thuê xe đầu kéo container đi\\n            Phú Quốc</span></strong></p>\\n\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 15px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; margin: 0px 0px 0px 96px; text-align: justify; text-indent: -24px; line-height: normal; background: white;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 13px; font-family: &quot;Courier New&quot;;\\\"><span>o<span style=\\\"font: 9px &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><strong><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 17px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; color: black;\\\">Dịch vụ cho thuê xe cẩu tại Phú Quốc</span></strong></p>\\n\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 15px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; margin: 0px 0px 0px 96px; text-align: justify; text-indent: -24px; line-height: normal; background: white;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 13px; font-family: &quot;Courier New&quot;;\\\"><span>o<span style=\\\"font: 9px &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><strong><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 17px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; color: black;\\\">Chành xe Phú Quốc</span></strong></p>\\n\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 15px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; margin: 0px 0px 0px 96px; text-align: justify; text-indent: -24px; line-height: normal; background: white;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 13px; font-family: &quot;Courier New&quot;;\\\"><span>o<span style=\\\"font: 9px &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><strong><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 17px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; color: black;\\\">Gửi hàng nhỏ lẻ đi Phú Quốc</span></strong></p>\\n\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 15px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; margin: 0px 0px 0px 96px; text-align: justify; text-indent: -24px; line-height: normal; background: white;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 13px; font-family: &quot;Courier New&quot;;\\\"><span>o<span style=\\\"font: 9px &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><strong><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 17px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; color: black;\\\">Vận chuyển hàng hóa đi Phú Quốc ..</span></strong><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 17px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; color: black;\\\">. và một số dịch vụ hỗ trợ việc vận chuyển\\n        mở rộng:<span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">&nbsp;</span><strong>nhận đóng kiện gỗ\\n            hàng hóa, nhận bốc xếp hàng hóa, cho thuê xe nâng máy, cho thuê xe nâng tay</strong>&nbsp;</span>…</p>\\n\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 15px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; margin: 0px 0px 0px 48px; text-align: justify; text-indent: -24px; line-height: normal; background: white;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 13px; font-family: Symbol;\\\"><span>¾<span style=\\\"font: 9px &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\\n            </span></span></span><strong><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 17px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; color: black;\\\">Con\\n            Rùa Biển</span></strong><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 17px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; color: black;\\\">&nbsp;</span>sẽ&nbsp;cử Chuyên viên phụ\\n    trách đến tận nơi kiểm tra “Mặt hàng” cần vận chuyển</p>\\n\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 15px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; margin: 0px 0px 0px 48px; text-align: justify; text-indent: -24px; line-height: normal; background: white;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 13px; font-family: Symbol;\\\"><span>¾<span style=\\\"font: 9px &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\\n            </span></span></span><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 17px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; color: black;\\\">Xác định\\n        trọng lượng hàng hóa, kích thước hàng hóa, địa chỉ giao nhận hàng hóa, thời\\n        gian yêu cầu vận chuyển hàng hóa</span></p>\\n\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 15px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; margin: 0px 0px 0px 48px; text-align: justify; text-indent: -24px; line-height: normal; background: white;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 13px; font-family: Symbol;\\\"><span>¾<span style=\\\"font: 9px &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\\n            </span></span></span><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 17px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; color: black;\\\">Sau\\n        khi gặp trực tiếp và trao đổi, Con Rùa Biển sẽ tư vấn cho Quý khách hàng cách\\n        thức vận chuyển hàng hóa (hoặc<span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">&nbsp;</span><strong>dịch\\n            vụ vận chuyển hàng hóa đi Phú Quốc</strong>) sao cho đảm bảo an toàn, cũng như là tư\\n        vấn cách đóng gói hàng hóa khi vận chuyển đảm bảo an toàn không bị hư hỏng\\n        trong quá trình vận chuyển đường dài.</span></p>\\n\\n<h2 style=\\\"margin-right: 0px; font-size: 24px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-weight: bold; margin-left: 48px; text-align: justify; text-indent: -24px;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 17px; color: rgb(228, 108, 10);\\\"><span>2*)</span></span><strong style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 17px; color: rgb(228, 108, 10);\\\">Báo giá vận chuyển hàng hóa:</span></strong></h2>\\n\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 15px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; margin: 0px 0px 0px 48px; text-align: justify; text-indent: -24px; line-height: normal; background: white;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 13px; font-family: Symbol;\\\"><span>¾<span style=\\\"font: 9px &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\\n            </span></span></span><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 17px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; color: black;\\\">Dựa\\n        vào thông tin hàng hóa đã thực tế kiểm tra được để báo giá gồm có:</span></p>\\n\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 15px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; margin: 0px 0px 0px 96px; text-align: justify; text-indent: -24px; line-height: normal; background: white;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 13px; font-family: &quot;Courier New&quot;;\\\"><span>o<span style=\\\"font: 9px &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 17px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; color: black;\\\">Trọng lượng / kiện</span></p>\\n\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 15px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; margin: 0px 0px 0px 96px; text-align: justify; text-indent: -24px; line-height: normal; background: white;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 13px; font-family: &quot;Courier New&quot;;\\\"><span>o<span style=\\\"font: 9px &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 17px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; color: black;\\\">Kích thước / kiện</span></p>\\n\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 15px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; margin: 0px 0px 0px 96px; text-align: justify; text-indent: -24px; line-height: normal; background: white;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 13px; font-family: &quot;Courier New&quot;;\\\"><span>o<span style=\\\"font: 9px &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 17px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; color: black;\\\">Tổng số kiện đã thực tế kiểm tra</span></p>\\n\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 15px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; margin: 0px 0px 0px 96px; text-align: justify; text-indent: -24px; line-height: normal; background: white;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 13px; font-family: &quot;Courier New&quot;;\\\"><span>o<span style=\\\"font: 9px &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 17px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; color: black;\\\">Nơi gửi hàng [nơi điều xe tải đi lấy hàng]</span></p>\\n\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 15px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; margin: 0px 0px 0px 96px; text-align: justify; text-indent: -24px; line-height: normal; background: white;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 13px; font-family: &quot;Courier New&quot;;\\\"><span>o<span style=\\\"font: 9px &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 17px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; color: black;\\\">Nơi đến [nơi giao hàng tận nơi]</span></p>\\n\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 15px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; margin: 0px 0px 0px 48px; text-align: justify; text-indent: -24px; line-height: normal; background: white;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 13px; font-family: Symbol;\\\"><span>¾<span style=\\\"font: 9px &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\\n            </span></span></span><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 17px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; color: black;\\\">Sau\\n        đó đưa ra mức giá phù hợp để vận chuyển toàn bộ lô hàng theo yêu cầu mà bên gửi\\n        hàng đưa ra.</span></p>\\n\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 15px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; margin: 0px 0px 0px 48px; text-align: justify; text-indent: -24px; line-height: normal; background: white;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 13px; font-family: Symbol;\\\"><span>¾<span style=\\\"font: 9px &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\\n            </span></span></span><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 17px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; color: black;\\\">Xác\\n        nhận báo giá bằng văn bản (<strong>báo giá vận chuyển hàng hóa</strong>).</span></p>\\n\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 15px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; margin: 0px 0px 0px 48px; text-align: justify; text-indent: -24px; line-height: normal; background: white;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 13px; font-family: Symbol;\\\"><span>¾<span style=\\\"font: 9px &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\\n            </span></span></span><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 17px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; color: black;\\\">Lập\\n        phiếu yêu cầu vận chuyển hàng hóa.</span></p>\\n\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 15px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; margin: 0px 0px 0px 48px; text-align: justify; text-indent: -24px; line-height: normal; background: white;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 13px; font-family: Symbol;\\\"><span>¾<span style=\\\"font: 9px &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\\n            </span></span></span><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 17px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; color: black;\\\">Lên hợp\\n        đồng vận chuyển hàng hóa (hoặc<span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">&nbsp;</span><strong>hợp\\n            đồng vận chuyển hàng hóa đi Phú Quốc</strong>), cũng như là cam kết ngày gửi hàng và\\n        giao hàng theo đúng tiến độ thực hiện.</span></p>\\n\\n<h2 style=\\\"margin-right: 0px; font-size: 24px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-weight: bold; margin-left: 48px; text-align: justify; text-indent: -24px;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 17px; color: rgb(228, 108, 10);\\\"><span>3*)</span></span><strong style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 17px; color: rgb(228, 108, 10);\\\">Điều xe để lấy hàng:</span></strong></h2>\\n\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 15px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; margin: 0px 0px 0px 48px; text-align: justify; text-indent: -24px; line-height: normal; background: white;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 13px; font-family: Symbol;\\\"><span>¾<span style=\\\"font: 9px &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\\n            </span></span></span><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 17px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; color: black;\\\">Sắp xếp\\n        xe tải lớn (hoặc các loại xe phù hợp với nhu cầu thực tế) để lấy hàng tận nơi\\n        theo yêu cầu<span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">&nbsp;</span><strong style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">vận chuyển hàng hóa</strong><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">&nbsp;</span>đã được thỏa thuận</span></p>\\n\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 15px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; margin: 0px 0px 0px 48px; text-align: justify; text-indent: -24px; line-height: normal; background: white;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 13px; font-family: Symbol;\\\"><span>¾<span style=\\\"font: 9px &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\\n            </span></span></span><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 17px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; color: black;\\\">Đối với\\n        hàng có trọng lượng trên 100kg/kiện thì sẽ được điều xe cẩu (tải trọng cẩu phù\\n        hợp) để đưa hàng lên xe tải lớn tại địa điểm gửi hàng (nếu trong hợp đồng đã có\\n        thỏa thuận bao bốc xếp)</span></p>\\n\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 15px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; margin: 0px 0px 0px 48px; text-align: justify; text-indent: -24px; line-height: normal; background: white;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 13px; font-family: Symbol;\\\"><span>¾<span style=\\\"font: 9px &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\\n            </span></span></span><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 17px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; color: black;\\\">Ký\\n        biên bản giao nhận hàng hoá tại nơi nhận, xác nhận và kiểm tra thực tế việc\\n        giao nhận hàng hóa tại nơi gửi.</span></p>\\n\\n<h2 style=\\\"margin-right: 0px; font-size: 24px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-weight: bold; margin-left: 48px; text-align: justify; text-indent: -24px;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 17px; color: rgb(228, 108, 10);\\\"><span>4*)</span></span><strong style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 17px; color: rgb(228, 108, 10);\\\">Giao hàng tận nơi:</span></strong></h2>\\n\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 15px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; margin: 0px 0px 0px 48px; text-align: justify; text-indent: -24px; line-height: normal; background: white;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 13px; font-family: Symbol;\\\"><span>¾<span style=\\\"font: 9px &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\\n            </span></span></span><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 17px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; color: black;\\\">Khi\\n        xe đi hàng đường dài sẽ alo cho người nhận trước 1 ngày, nếu đi gần thì alo cho\\n        người nhận trước khi giao hàng 2 giờ, để 2 bên cùng phối hợp giao nhận cho hợp\\n        lý.</span></p>\\n\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 15px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; margin: 0px 0px 0px 48px; text-align: justify; text-indent: -24px; line-height: normal; background: white;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 13px; font-family: Symbol;\\\"><span>¾<span style=\\\"font: 9px &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\\n            </span></span></span><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 17px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; color: black;\\\">Cho\\n        xe cẩu hàng từ xe tải lớn đưa hàng xuống đất nếu đó là hàng nặng và có thỏa thuận\\n        bao cẩu hạ hàng.</span></p>\\n\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 15px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; margin: 0px 0px 0px 48px; text-align: justify; text-indent: -24px; line-height: normal; background: white;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 13px; font-family: Symbol;\\\"><span>¾<span style=\\\"font: 9px &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\\n            </span></span></span><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 17px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; color: black;\\\">Ký<span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">&nbsp;</span><strong style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">biên\\n            bản giao nhận vận chuyển hàng hoá</strong><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">&nbsp;</span>sau\\n        khi hoàn tất việc giao hàng.</span></p>\\n\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 15px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; margin: 0px 0px 0px 48px; text-align: justify; text-indent: -24px; line-height: normal; background: white;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 13px; font-family: Symbol;\\\"><span>¾<span style=\\\"font: 9px &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\\n            </span></span></span><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 17px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; color: black;\\\">Đem về\\n        biên bản giao nhận hàng hoá có đầy đủ chữ ký của người nhận về lại công ty và gửi\\n        1 bản chính về lại cho người gửi nếu có yêu cầu.</span></p>\\n\\n<h2 style=\\\"margin-right: 0px; font-size: 24px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-weight: bold; margin-left: 48px; text-align: justify; text-indent: -24px;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 17px; color: rgb(228, 108, 10);\\\"><span>5*)</span></span><strong style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 17px; color: rgb(228, 108, 10);\\\">Kết thúc hợp đồng theo lô và thanh toán tiền cước vận chuyển.</span></strong></h2>\\n\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 15px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; margin: 0px 0px 0px 48px; text-align: justify; text-indent: -24px; line-height: normal; background: white;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 13px; font-family: Symbol;\\\"><span>¾<span style=\\\"font: 9px &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\\n            </span></span></span><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 17px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; color: black;\\\">Chuyển\\n        hồ sơ hợp đồng qua phòng kế toán làm bảng kê cước phí vận chuyển hàng hóa</span></p>\\n\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 15px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; margin: 0px 0px 0px 48px; text-align: justify; text-indent: -24px; line-height: normal; background: white;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 13px; font-family: Symbol;\\\"><span>¾<span style=\\\"font: 9px &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\\n            </span></span></span><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 17px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; color: black;\\\">Xuất\\n        hóa đơn</span></p>\\n\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 15px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; margin: 0px 0px 0px 48px; text-align: justify; text-indent: -24px; line-height: normal; background: white;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 13px; font-family: Symbol;\\\"><span>¾<span style=\\\"font: 9px &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\\n            </span></span></span><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 17px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; color: black;\\\">Thu\\n        tiền</span></p>\\n\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 15px; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; margin: 0px 0px 0px 48px; text-align: justify; text-indent: -24px; line-height: normal; background: white;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 13px; font-family: Symbol;\\\"><span>¾<span style=\\\"font: 9px &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\\n            </span></span></span><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 17px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; color: black;\\\">Kết\\n        thúc một đơn hàng</span></p>\\n\\n<p align=\\\"right\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 16px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; margin: 0px; text-align: right; line-height: 22px; background: white; box-sizing: border-box; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; orphans: 2; widows: 2; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; word-spacing: 0px;\\\"><br></p><p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; color: rgb(200, 50, 43); font-family: &quot;\\\\&quot;roboto\\\\&quot;, helvetica, arial&quot;, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; backgr