ht: bold;\\\">nội thất</strong>, bàn ghế, ghế sofa, ghế salon …</span></p><p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 22px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; color: rgb(200, 50, 43); font-family: &quot;\\\\&quot;roboto\\\\&quot;, helvetica, arial&quot;, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: justify;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\\">Nên đã dẫn đến việc rất nhiều khách hàng bị hư hỏng hàng hóa<span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">&nbsp;</span><strong style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold;\\\">nội thất</strong><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">&nbsp;</span>trong quá trình<span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">&nbsp;</span><strong style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold;\\\">vận chuyển hàng</strong><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">&nbsp;</span><strong style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold;\\\">nội thất</strong><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">&nbsp;</span>bằng xe tải đi đường bộ.</span></p><p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 22px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; color: rgb(200, 50, 43); font-family: &quot;\\\\&quot;roboto\\\\&quot;, helvetica, arial&quot;, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: justify;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\\">Nguyên nhân hư hỏng chủ yêu là do: đóng gói chưa được cẩn thận, sắp xếp hàng hóa lên xe tải không có thứ tự ưu tiên … và nhiều lý do khác dẫn đến hư hỏng.</span></p><p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 22px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; color: rgb(200, 50, 43); font-family: &quot;\\\\&quot;roboto\\\\&quot;, helvetica, arial&quot;, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\\\"><a data-mil=\\\"3043\\\" href=\\\"https://conruabien.vn/du-an-da-van-chuyen/du-an-van-chuyen-hang-noi-that/\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 102, 0); text-decoration: none;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(255, 102, 0);\\\">Xem thêm Hình ảnh dự án<span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">&nbsp;</span><strong style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold;\\\">vận chuyển hàng</strong><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">&nbsp;</span><strong style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold;\\\">nội thất</strong></span><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 18pt;\\\"><strong style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold;\\\">Click xem tại đây</strong></span></a></p><div id=\\\"attachment_2814\\\" class=\\\"wp-caption alignnone\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 