 và nhỏ xếp sau và xếp bên trên</span></li></ul><div id=\\\"attachment_1380\\\" class=\\\"wp-caption alignnone\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 5px 20px 20px 0px; background: rgb(247, 247, 247); border: 1px solid rgb(230, 230, 230); max-width: 100%; padding: 10px; text-align: center; color: rgb(200, 50, 43); font-family: &quot;\\\\&quot;roboto\\\\&quot;, helvetica, arial&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; width: 2410px;\\\"><img aria-describedby=\\\"caption-attachment-1380\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" loading=\\\"lazy\\\" class=\\\"size-full wp-image-1380\\\" src=\\\"https://conruabien.vn/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/h%C6%B0%E1%BB%9Bng-d%E1%BA%ABn-chia-s%E1%BA%BD-kinh-nghi%E1%BB%87m-%C4%91%C3%B3ng-g%C3%B3i-v%C3%A0-v%E1%BA%ADn-chuy%E1%BB%83n-n%E1%BB%99i-th%E1%BA%A5t-%C4%91i-%C4%91%C6%B0%E1%BB%9Dng-b%E1%BB%99-b%E1%BA%B1ng-xe-t%E1%BA%A3i-13.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"hướng dẫn chia sẽ kinh nghiệm đóng gói và vận chuyển nội thất đi đường bộ bằng xe tải 13\\\" width=\\\"2400\\\" height=\\\"2233\\\" srcset=\\\"https://conruabien.vn/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/hướng-dẫn-chia-sẽ-kinh-nghiệm-đóng-gói-và-vận-chuyển-nội-thất-đi-đường-bộ-bằng-xe-tải-13.jpg 2400w, https://conruabien.vn/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/hướng-dẫn-chia-sẽ-kinh-nghiệm-đóng-gói-và-vận-chuyển-nội-thất-đi-đường-bộ-bằng-xe-tải-13-768x715.jpg 768w\\\" sizes=\\\"(max-width: 2400px) 100vw, 2400px\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px none; vertical-align: middle; max-width: 100%; position: relative; height: auto; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; width: auto;\\\"><p id=\\\"caption-attachment-1380\\\" class=\\\"wp-caption-text\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-b