rong></span></h3><p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 22px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; color: rgb(200, 50, 43); font-family: &quot;\\\\&quot;roboto\\\\&quot;, helvetica, arial&quot;, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\\">Dựa vào thông tin hàng hóa đã thực tế kiểm tra được:</span></p><ul style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; color: rgb(200, 50, 43); font-family: &quot;\\\\&quot;roboto\\\\&quot;, helvetica, arial&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\\\"><li style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\\">Trọng lượng / kiện</span></li><li style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\\">Kích thước / kiện</span></li><li style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\\">Tổng số kiện đã thực tế kiểm tra</span></li><li style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\\">Nơi gửi hàng</span></li><li style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\\">Nơi giao hàng</span></li></ul><p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 22px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; color: rgb(200, 50, 43); font-family: &quot;\\\\&quot;roboto\\\\&quot;, helvetica, arial&quot;, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\\">Sau đó đưa ra mức giá phù hợp để vận chuyển toàn bộ lô hàng theo yêu cầu.</span></p><p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 22px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; color: rgb(200, 50, 43); font-family: &quot;\\\\&quot;roboto\\\\&quot;, helvetica, arial&quot;, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\\">Xác nhận báo giá bằng văn bản</span></p><p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 22px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; color: rgb(200, 50, 43); font-family: &quot;\\\\&quot;roboto\\\\&quot;, helvetica, arial&quot;, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\\">Lập phiếu yêu cầu vận chuyển hàng hóa.</span></p><p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 22px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; color: rgb(200, 50, 43); font-family: &quot;\\\\&quot;roboto\\\\&quot;, helvetica, arial&quot;, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\\">Lên hợp đồng thỏa thuận vận chuyển hàng hóa</span></p><h3 data-header=\\\"14\\\" id=\\\"ftoc-heading-15\\\" class=\\\"ftwp-heading\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: utm_helveins; font-weight: normal !important; line-height: 1.4; color: rgb(10, 10, 10); margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 10px; font-size: 24px; text-transform: none; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\\"><strong style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold;\\\">3.Điều xe để lấy hàng để vận chuyển:</strong></span></h3><p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 22px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; color: rgb(200, 50, 43); font-family: &quot;\\\\&quot;roboto\\\\&quot;, helvetica, arial&quot;, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\\">Sắp xếp xe tải lớn (hoặc các loại xe phù hợp với nhu cầu thực tế) để lấy hàng tận nơi theo thỏa thuận.</span></p><p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 22px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; color: rgb(200, 50, 43); font-family: &quot;\\\\&quot;roboto\\\\&quot;, helvetica, arial&quot;, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\\">Đối với hàng có trọng lượng trên 100kg/kiện thì sẽ được điều xe cẩu (tải trọng cẩu phù hợp) để đưa hàng lên xe tải lớn (nếu có thỏa thuận)</span></p><p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 22px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; color: rgb(200, 50, 43); font-family: &quot;\\\\&quot;roboto\\\\&quot;, helvetica, arial&quot;, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\\">Ký biên bản giao nhận hàng hoá tại nơi gửi hàng (có xác nhận và kiểm tra)</span></p><h3 data-header=\\\"15\\\" id=\\\"ftoc-heading-16\\\" class=\\\"ftwp-heading\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: utm_helveins; font-weight: normal !important; line-height: 1.4; color: rgb(10, 10, 10); margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 10px; font-size: 24px; text-transform: none; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\\"><strong style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold;\\\">4.Giao hàng tận nơi:</strong></span></h3><p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 22px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; color: rgb(200, 50, 43); font-family: &quot;\\\\&quot;roboto\\\\&quot;, helvetica, arial&quot;, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\\">Khi xe đi hàng đường dài sẽ alo cho người nhận trước 1 ngày, nếu đi gần thì alo cho người nhận trước khi giao hàng 2 giờ, để 2 bên cùng phối hợp giao nhận cho thuận tiện.</span></p><p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 22px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; color: rgb(200, 50, 43); font-family: &quot;\\\\&quot;roboto\\\\&quot;, helvetica, arial&quot;, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\\">Điều xe cẩu lớn đến nơi giao hàng (hoặc điều động công nhân bốc xếp) nếu có thỏa thuận.</span></p><p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 22px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; color: rgb(200, 50, 43); font-family: &quot;\\\\&quot;roboto\\\\&quot;, helvetica, arial&quot;, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\\">Ký biên bản giao nhận hàng hoá sau khi hoàn tất việc giao hàng.</span></p><p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 22px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; color: rgb(200, 50, 43); font-family: &quot;\\\\&quot;roboto\\\\&quot;, helvetica, arial&quot;, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\\">Đem về biên bản giao nhận hàng hoá có đầy đủ chữ ký của người nhận về lại công ty và gửi 1 bản chính về lại cho người gửi nếu có yêu cầu.</span></p><h3 data-header=\\\"16\\\" id=\\\"ftoc-heading-17\\\" class=\\\"ftwp-heading\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: utm_helveins; font-weight: normal !important; line-height: 1.4; color: rgb(10, 10, 10); margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 10px; font-size: 24px; text-transform: none; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\\"><strong style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold;\\\">5.Kết thúc hợp đồng theo lô và thanh toán tiền cước vận chuyển.</strong></span></h3><p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 22px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; color: rgb(200, 50, 43); font-family: &quot;\\\\&quot;roboto\\\\&quot;, helvetica, arial&quot;, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\\">Chuyển hồ sơ hợp đồng qua phòng kế toán làm bảng kê cước phí vận chuyển hàng hóa</span></p><p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 22px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; color: rgb(200, 50, 43); font-family: &quot;\\\\&quot;roboto\\\\&quot;, helvetica, arial&quot;, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\\">Xuất hóa đơn vận chuyển hàng hóa</span></p><p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 22px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; color: rgb(200, 50, 43); font-family: &quot;\\\\&quot;roboto\\\\&quot;, helvetica, arial&quot;, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\\">Thu tiền đơn hàng đã vận chuyển hoàn thành.</span></p><p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 22px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; color: rgb(200, 50