c</span></li><li style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\\">Dịch vụ<span>&nbsp;</span><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(255, 102, 0);\\\"><a data-mil=\\\"469\\\" href=\\\"https://conruabien.vn/dich-vu-mo-rong/dich-vu-dong-kien-go/\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 102, 0); text-decoration: none;\\\"><strong style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold;\\\">đóng kiện gỗ</strong></a><span>&nbsp;</span></span>bảo quả hàng hóa trong quá trình vận chuyển hàng đi Phú Quốc</span></li><li style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\\">Dịch vụ<span>&nbsp;</span><strong style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold;\\\">cho thuê kho bãi</strong><span>&nbsp;</span>chứa hàng hóa ở Phú Quốc miễn phí ngắn hạn.</span></li><li style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\\">Dịch vụ<span>&nbsp;</span><strong style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold;\\\">vận chuyển đường hàng không đi Phú Quốc</strong></span></li><li style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\\">Dịch vụ<span>&nbsp;</span><strong style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold;\\\">vận chuyển đường biển đi Phú Quốc</strong></span></li><li style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\\">Dịch vụ<span>&nbsp;</span><strong style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold;\\\">vận chuyển hàng hóa đường sắt Bắc Nam</strong></span></li><li style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\\">Dịch vụ<span>&nbsp;</span><strong style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold;\\\">cho thuê xà lan đi Phú Quốc</strong><span>&nbsp;</span>và các tỉnh miền tây</span></li><li style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\\">Dịch vụ<span>&nbsp;</span><strong style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold;\\\">khai hải quan hàng nhập</strong></span></li><li style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\\">Dịch vụ<span>&nbsp;</span><strong style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold;\\\">chuyển phát nhanh</strong><span>&nbsp;</span><strong style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold;\\\">đi Phú Quốc</strong></span></li></ul><div id=\\\"attachment_3275\\\" class=\\\"wp-caption alignnone\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 5px 20px 20px 0px; background: rgb(247, 247, 247); border: 1px solid rgb(230, 230, 230); max-width: 100%; padding: 10px; text-align: center; color: rgb(200, 50, 43); font-family: &quot;\\\\&quot;roboto\\\\&quot;, helvetica, arial&quot;, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; width: 2410px; font-size: 14px;\\\"><img aria-describedby=\\\"caption-attachment-3275\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" loading=\\\"lazy\\\" class=\\\"size-full wp-image-3275\\\" src=\\\"https://conruabien.vn/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Cho-thue-Pha-cho-xe-tai-xe-container-di-Hon-Thom-Phu-Quoc-4.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"Cho thue Pha cho xe tai xe container di Hon Thom Phu Quoc 4\\\" width=\\\"2400\\\" height=\\\"1468\\\" srcset=\\\"https://conruabien.vn/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Cho-thue-Pha-cho-xe-tai-xe-container-di-Hon-Thom-Phu-Quoc-4.jpg 2400w, https://conruabien.vn/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Cho-thue-Pha-cho-xe-tai-xe-container-di-Hon-Thom-Phu-Quoc-4-768x470.jpg 768w, https://conruabien.vn/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Cho-thue-Pha-cho-xe