gb(230, 230, 230); max-width: 100%; padding: 10px; text-align: center; color: rgb(200, 50, 43); font-family: &quot;\\\\&quot;roboto\\\\&quot;, helvetica, arial&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; width: 2410px;\\\"><img aria-describedby=\\\"caption-attachment-4250\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" class=\\\"size-full wp-image-4250\\\" src=\\\"https://conruabien.vn/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/Chanh-xe-van-chuyen-hang-hoa-tu-sai-gon-di-phu-quoc-2022-05-25-5.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"Chanh xe van chuyen hang hoa tu sai gon di phu quoc 2022 05 25 5\\\" width=\\\"2400\\\" height=\\\"1800\\\" srcset=\\\"https://conruabien.vn/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/Chanh-xe-van-chuyen-hang-hoa-tu-sai-gon-di-phu-quoc-2022-05-25-5.jpg 2400w, https://conruabien.vn/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/Chanh-xe-van-chuyen-hang-hoa-tu-sai-gon-di-phu-quoc-2022-05-25-5-768x576.jpg 768w, https://conruabien.vn/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/Chanh-xe-van-chuyen-hang-hoa-tu-sai-gon-di-phu-quoc-2022-05-25-5-1536x1152.jpg 1536w, https://conruabien.vn/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/Chanh-xe-van-chuyen-hang-hoa-tu-sai-gon-di-phu-quoc-2022-05-25-5-2048x1536.jpg 2048w\\\" sizes=\\\"(max-width: 2400px) 100vw, 2400px\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; height: auto; max-width: 100%; border: 0px none; vertical-align: middle; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; width: auto;\\\"><p id=\\\"caption-attachment-4250\\\" class=\\\"wp-caption-text\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; font-size: 11px; line-height: 17px; padding: 5px;\\\">(Hình ảnh Chành xe Hà Nội Sài Gòn Phú Quốc – CON RÙA BIỂN nhận vận chuyển hàng hóa đi Phú Quốc; Trong ảnh là cảnh xe tải chở hàng đá lát nền, đá lát đường, đá hoa cương từ Đồng Nai đi Phú Quốc, và xe tải đang trả hàng tại chân công trình ở An Thới Phú Quốc, và được xe cẩu lớn cẩu hạ tại chỗ rất thuận tiện cho việc giao nhận hàng hóa trên đảo Phú Quốc)</p></div><div id=\\\"attachment_4243\\\" class=\\\"wp-caption alignnone\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 5px 20px 20px 0px; background: rgb(247, 247, 247); border: 1px solid rgb(230, 230, 230); max-width: 100%; padding: 10px; text-align: center; color: rgb(200, 50, 43); font-family: &quot;\\\\&quot;roboto\\\\&quot;, helvetica, arial&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; width: 2410px;\\\"><img aria-describedby=\\\"caption-attachment-4243\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" loading=\\\"lazy\\\" class=\\\"size-full wp-image-4243\\\" src=\\\"https://conruabien.vn/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/Chanh-xe-van-chuyen-hang-hoa-di-Phu-Quoc-2022-05-26-46.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"Chanh xe van chuyen hang hoa di Phu Quoc 2022 05 26 46\\\" width=\\\"2400\\\" height=\\\"1800\\\" srcset=\\\"https://conruabien.vn/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/Chanh-xe-van-chuyen-hang-hoa-di-Phu-Quoc-2022-05-26-46.jpg 2400w, https://conruabien.vn/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/Chanh-xe-van-chuyen-hang-hoa-di-Phu-Quoc-2022-05-26-46-768x576.jpg 768w, https://conruabien.vn/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/Chanh-xe-van-chuyen-hang-hoa-di-Phu-Quoc-2022-05-26-46-1536x1152.jpg 1536w, https://conruabien.vn/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/Chanh-xe-van-chuyen-hang-hoa-di-Phu-Quoc-2022-05-26-46-2048x1536.jpg 2048w\\\" sizes=\\\"(max-width: 2400px) 100vw, 2400px\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; height: auto; max-width: 100%; border: 0px none; vertical-align: middle; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; w