ùng với nhiều loại hàng hóa khác để tiết kiệm chi phí vận chuyển, đây là hình thức đi ghép phổ biến nhất hiện nay tại chành xe chuyến tuyến đi Phú Quốc)</p></div><div id=\\\"attachment_3548\\\" class=\\\"wp-caption alignnone\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 5px 20px 20px 0px; background: rgb(247, 247, 247); border: 1px solid rgb(230, 230, 230); max-width: 100%; padding: 10px; text-align: center; color: rgb(200, 50, 43); font-family: &quot;\\\\&quot;roboto\\\\&quot;, helvetica, arial&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; width: 1930px;\\\"><img aria-describedby=\\\"caption-attachment-3548\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" loading=\\\"lazy\\\" class=\\\"size-full wp-image-3548\\\" src=\\\"https://conruabien.vn/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Van-chuyen-may-bom-di-Phu-Quoc-theo-hinh-thuc-ghep-hang-nho-le-16-scaled.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"Van chuyen may bom di Phu Quoc theo hinh thuc ghep hang nho le 16 scaled\\\" width=\\\"1920\\\" height=\\\"2560\\\" srcset=\\\"https://conruabien.vn/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Van-chuyen-may-bom-di-Phu-Quoc-theo-hinh-thuc-ghep-hang-nho-le-16-scaled.jpg 1920w, https://conruabien.vn/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Van-chuyen-may-bom-di-Phu-Quoc-theo-hinh-thuc-ghep-hang-nho-le-16-768x1024.jpg 768w, https://conruabien.vn/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Van-chuyen-may-bom-di-Phu-Quoc-theo-hinh-thuc-ghep-hang-nho-le-16-1152x1536.jpg 1152w, https://conruabien.vn/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Van-chuyen-may-bom-di-Phu-Quoc-theo-hinh-thuc-ghep-hang-nho-le-16-1536x2048.jpg 1536w\\\" sizes=\\\"(max-width: 1920px) 100vw, 1920px\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; height: auto; max-width: 100%; border: 0px none; vertic