ata-mil=\\\"2949\\\" href=\\\"https://conruabien.vn/dich-vu-chinh/cho-thue-xe-tai-di-phu-quoc/\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 102, 0); text-decoration: none;\\\">Cho thuê xe tải</a><span>&nbsp;</span>chở hàng rau củ quả đi Phú Quốc hằng ngày</span></p><p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; color: rgb(200, 50, 43); font-family: &quot;\\\\&quot;roboto\\\\&quot;, helvetica, arial&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; text-align: justify;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\\">Nhận chở hàng thực phẩm tươi sống đi Phú Quốc bằng xe tải đông lạnh</span></p><p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; color: rgb(200, 50, 43); font-family: &quot;\\\\&quot;roboto\\\\&quot;, helvetica, arial&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; text-align: justify;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\\"><a data-mil=\\\"2949\\\" href=\\\"https://conruabien.vn/dich-vu-chinh/cho-thue-xe-dau-keo-xe-container/\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 102, 0); text-decoration: none;\\\">Cho thuê xe đầu kéo container</a><span>&nbsp;</span>chở hàng thực phẩm đi Phú Quốc nguyên container, nguyên seal</span></p><p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; color: rgb(200, 50, 43); font-family: &quot;\\\\&quot;roboto\\\\&quot;, helvetica, arial&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; text-align: justify;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\\">Nhận hàng tận nơi tại Đà Lạt, Lâm Đồng, Bảo Lộc, Gia Lai, Đắk Lắk, Kumtum đi Phú Quốc trong thời gian 2 ngày.</span></p><p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; color: rgb(200, 50, 43); font-family: &quot;\\\\&quot;roboto\\\\&quot;, helvetica, arial&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\\\">Xem thêm:<span>&nbsp;</span><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(255, 102, 0);\\\"><strong style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold;\\\"><a data-mil=\\\"2949\\\" href=\\\"https://conruabien.vn/du-an-da-van-chuyen/du-an-van-chuyen-hang-noi-that-di-phu-quoc-0945000006/\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; background-color: transparent; color: rgb(255, 102, 0); text-decoration: none;\\\">Dự án Vận chuyển hàng nội thất đi Phú Quốc</a></strong></span></p><div id=\\\"attachment_2954\\\" class=\\\"wp-caption alignnone\