n: middle; overflow: hidden; word-break: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\\\">Ký biên bản giao nhận hàng hoá tại nơi gửi hàng (có xác nhận và kiểm tra)</td></tr><tr class=\\\"wpdt-cell-row \\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\"><td class=\\\"wpdt-cell wpdt-ff-000003 wpdt-tc-151414 wpdt-align-center wpdt-bc-FCE8FF\\\" data-cell-id=\\\"A23\\\" data-col-index=\\\"0\\\" data-row-index=\\\"22\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 10px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif !important; color: rgb(21, 20, 20) !important; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: center; border: 1px solid rgb(204, 204, 204); height: 22px; empty-cells: show; line-height: normal; vertical-align: middle; overflow: hidden; word-break: normal;\\\">6.1</td><td class=\\\"wpdt-cell wpdt-ff-000003 wpdt-align-left wpdt-tc-F44336 wpdt-bold wpdt-merged-cell \\\" colspan=\\\"1\\\" rowspan=\\\"6\\\" data-cell-id=\\\"B23\\\" data-col-index=\\\"1\\\" data-row-index=\\\"22\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 10px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif !important; color: rgb(244, 67, 54) !important; font-weight: bold !important; text-align: center; border: 1px solid rgb(204, 204, 204); height: 22px; empty-cells: show; line-height: normal; vertical-align: middle; overflow: hidden; word-break: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\\\">Giao nhận hàng tận nơi theo yêu cầu</td><td class=\\\"wpdt-cell wpdt-ff-000003 wpdt-tc-151414 wpdt-bc-FCE8FF wpdt-align-justify\\\" data-cell-id=\\\"C23\\\" data-col-index=\\\"2\\\" data-row-index=\\\"22\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 10px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif !important; color: rgb(21, 20, 20) !important; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: center; border: 1px solid rgb(204, 204, 204); height: 22px; empty-cells: show; line-height: normal; vertical-align: middle; overflow: hidden; word-break: normal;\\\">Nếu khoảng cách vận chuyển cần phải di chuyển trong nhiều ngày thì khi hàng gần đến nơi Lái xe sẽ gọi điện thoại cho người nhận thông báo thời gian xe đến nơi trước 1 ngày để người nhận có thời gian chuẩn bị phương án nhận hàng</td></tr><tr class=\\\"wpdt-cell-row \\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\"><td class=\\\"wpdt-cell wpdt-ff-000003 wpdt-tc-151414 wpdt-align-center\\\" data-cell-id=\\\"A24\\\" data-col-index=\\\"0\\\" data-row-index=\\\"23\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 10px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif !important; color: rgb(21, 20, 20) !important; text-align: center; border: 1px solid rgb(204, 204, 204); height: 22px; empty-cells: show; line-height: normal; vertical-align: middle; overflow: hidden; word-break: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\\\">6.2</td><td class=\\\"wpdt-cell wpdt-ff-000003 wpdt-tc-151414 wpdt-align-justify\\\" data-cell-id=\\\"C24\\\" data-col-index=\\\"2\\\" data-row-index=\\\"23\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 10px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif !important; color: rgb(21, 20, 20) !important; text-align: center; border: 1px solid rgb(204, 204, 204); height: 22px; empty-cells: show; line-height: normal; vertical-align: middle; overflow: hidden; word-break: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\\\">Nếu khoảng cách thực hiện dự án ngắn thì Lái xe sẽ thông báo cho người nhận sắp xếp nhận hàng trước 2 giờ, để hai bên cùng phối hợp giao nhận cho thuận lợi.</td></tr><tr class=\\\"wpdt-cell-row \\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\"><td class=\\\"wpdt-cell wpdt-ff-000003 wpdt-tc-151414 wpdt-align-center wpdt-bc-FCE8FF\\\" data-cell-id=\\\"A25\\\" data-col-index=\\\"0\\\" data-row-index=\\\"24\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 10px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif !important; color: rgb(21, 20, 20) !important; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: center; border: 1px solid rgb(204, 204, 204); height: 22px; empty-cells: show; line-height: normal; vertical-align: middle; overflow: hidden; word-break: normal;\\\">6.3</td><td class=\\\"wpdt-cell wpdt-ff-000003 wpdt-tc-151414 wpdt-bc-FCE8FF wpdt-align-justify\\\" data-cell-id=\\\"C25\\\" data-col-index=\\\"2\\\" data-row-index=\\\"24\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 10px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif !important; color: rgb(21, 20, 20) !important; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: center; border: 1px solid rgb(204, 204, 204); height: 22px; empty-cells: show; line-height: normal; vertical-align: middle; overflow: hidden; word-break: normal;\\\">Điều xe cẩu phù hợp [hoặc hàng lớn và nặng thì điều xe cẩu kato] đến nơi giao hàng (hoặc điều động công nhân bốc xếp) nếu có thỏa thuận.</td></tr><tr class=\\\"wpdt-cell-row \\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\"><td class=\\\"wpdt-cell wpdt-ff-000003 wpdt-tc-151414 wpdt-align-center\\\" data-cell-id=\\\"A26\\\" data-col-index=\\\"0\\\" data-row-index=\\\"25\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 10px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif !important; color: rgb(21, 20, 20) !important; text-align: center; border: 1px solid rgb(204, 204, 204); height: 22px; empty-cells: show; line-height: normal; vertical-align: middle; overflow: hidden; word-break: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\\\">6.4</td><td class=\\\"wpdt-cell wpdt-ff-000003 wpdt-tc-151414 wpdt-align-justify\\\" data-cell-id=\\\"C26\\\" data-col-index=\\\"2\\\" data-row-index=\\\"25\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 10px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif !important; color: rgb(21, 20, 20) !important; text-align: center; border: 1px solid rgb(204, 204, 204); height: 22px; empty-cells: show; line-height: normal; vertical-align: middle; overflow: hidden; word-break: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\\\">Bên vận chuyển sẽ cử đại diện giám sát việc giao nhận và kiểm điếm hàng hóa cùng với bên nhận hàng để hoàn thành công việc.</td></tr><tr class=\\\"wpdt-cell-row \\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\"><td class=\\\"wpdt-cell wpdt-ff-000003 wpdt-tc-151414 wpdt-align-center wpdt-bc-FCE8FF\\\" data-cell-id=\\\"A27\\\" data-col-index=\\\"0\\\" data-row-index=\\\"26\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 10px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif !important; color: rgb(21, 20, 20) !important; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: center; border: 1px solid rgb(204, 204, 204); height: 22px; empty-cells: show; line-height: normal; vertical-align: middle; overflow: hidden; word-break: normal;\\\">6.5</td><td class=\\\"wpdt-cell wpdt-ff-000003 wpdt-tc-151414 wpdt-bc-FCE8FF wpdt-align-justify\\\" data-cell-id=\\\"C27\\\" data-col-index=\\\"2\\\" data-row-index=\\\"26\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 10px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif !important; color: rgb(21, 20, 20) !important; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: center; border: 1px solid rgb(204, 204, 204); height: 22px; empty-cells: show; line-height: normal; vertical-align: middle; overflow: hidden; word-break: normal;\\\">Ký biên bản xác nhận công việc vận chuyển đã hoàn thành: hàng hóa đúng và đủ</td></tr><tr class=\\\"wpdt-cell-row \\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\"><td class=\\\"wpdt-cell wpdt-ff-000003 wpdt-tc-151414 wpdt-align-center\\\" data-cell-id=\\\"A28\\\" data-col-index=\\\"0\\\" data-row-index=\\\"27\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 10px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif !important; color: rgb(21, 20, 20) !important; text-align: center; border: 1px solid rgb(204, 204, 204); height: 22px; empty-cells: show; line-height: normal; vertical-align: middle; overflow: hidden; word-break: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\\\">6.6</td><td class=\\\"wpdt-cell wpdt-ff-000003 wpdt-tc-151414 wpdt-align-justify\\\" data-cell-id=\\\"C28\\\" data-col-index=\\\"2\\\" d