; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\\\">Cách Cảng Container Trung Tâm Sài Gòn (SPCT) và Cảng Sài Gòn – Hiệp Phước&nbsp;3km, cách&nbsp;Trung Tâm TP.HCM&nbsp;19km,&nbsp;Khu đô thị Phú Mỹ Hưng 12km.</p><p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; color: rgb(200, 50, 43); font-family: &quot;\\\\&quot;roboto\\\\&quot;, helvetica, arial&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\\\"><strong style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold;\\\">Tổng diện tích</strong>: 324ha</p><ol start=\\\"14\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; color: rgb(200, 50, 43); font-family: &quot;\\\\&quot;roboto\\\\&quot;, helvetica, arial&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\\\"><li style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\"><strong style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold;\\\"><em style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">Vận chuyển hàng h