);\\\">Dịch vụ<span>&nbsp;</span><strong style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold;\\\">vận chuyển đường biển đi Phú Quốc</strong></span></li><li style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\\">Dịch vụ<span>&nbsp;</span><strong style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold;\\\">vận chuyển hàng hóa đường sắt Bắc Nam</strong></span></li><li style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\\">Dịch vụ<span>&nbsp;</span><strong style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold;\\\">cho thuê xà lan đi Phú Quốc</strong><span>&nbsp;</span>và các tỉnh miền tây</span></li><li style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\\">Dịch vụ<span>&nbsp;</span><strong style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold;\\\">khai hải quan hàng nhập</strong></span></li><li style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\\">Dịch vụ<span>&nbsp;</span><strong style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold;\\\">chuyển phát nhanh</strong><span>&nbsp;</span><strong style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold;\\\">đi Phú Quốc</strong></span></li></ul><div id=\\\"attachment_1500\\\" class=\\\"wp-caption alignnone\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 5px 20px 20px 0px; background: rgb(247, 247, 247); border: 1px solid rgb(230, 230, 230); max-width: 100%; padding: 10px; text-align: center; color: rgb(200, 50, 43); font-family: &quot;\\\\&quot;roboto\\\\&quot;, helvetica, arial&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color