u sẽ được xe tải lớn loại 15 tấn hay 20 tấn đi giao tận nơi cho khách hàng ở tận chân công trình khắp đảo Phú Quốc)</p></div><div id=\\\"attachment_4209\\\" class=\\\"wp-caption alignnone\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 5px 20px 20px 0px; background: rgb(247, 247, 247); border: 1px solid rgb(230, 230, 230); max-width: 100%; padding: 10px; text-align: center; color: rgb(200, 50, 43); font-family: &quot;\\\\&quot;roboto\\\\&quot;, helvetica, arial&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; width: 2410px;\\\"><img aria-describedby=\\\"caption-attachment-4209\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" loading=\\\"lazy\\\" class=\\\"size-full wp-image-4209\\\" src=\\\"https://conruabien.vn/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/Chanh-xe-van-chuyen-hang-hoa-di-Phu-Quoc-2022-05-26-12.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"Chanh xe van chuyen hang hoa di Phu Quoc 2022 05 26 12\\\" width=\\\"2400\\\" height=\\\"1800\\\" srcset=\\\"https://conruabien.vn/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/Chanh-xe-van-chuyen-hang-hoa-di-Phu-Quoc-2022-05-26-12.jpg 2400w, https://conruabien.vn/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/Chanh-xe-van-chuyen-hang-hoa-di-Phu-Quoc-2022-05-26-12-768x576.jpg 768w, https://conruabien.vn/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/Chanh-xe-van-chuyen-hang-hoa-di-Phu-Quoc-2022-05-26-12-1536x1152.jpg 1536w, https://conruabien.vn/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/Chanh-xe-van-chuyen-hang-hoa-di-Phu-Quoc-2022-05-26-12-2048x1536.jpg 2048w\\\" sizes=\\\"(max-width: 2400px) 100vw, 2400px\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; height: auto; max-width: 100%; border: 0px none; vertical-align: middle; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; width: auto;\\\"><p id=\\\"caption-attachment-4209\\\" class=\\\"wp-caption-text