2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\\">Các đơn vị<span>&nbsp;</span><strong style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold;\\\">cho thuê xe đầu kéo đi Phú Quốc từ Hà Nội</strong><span>&nbsp;</span>sẽ cung cấp 2 loại hình dịch vụ là thuê theo chuyến và thuê theo thời gian. Thuê theo chuyến là hình thức<span>&nbsp;</span><strong style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold;\\\">cho thuê xe đầu kéo đi Phú Quốc từ Hà Nội</strong><span>&nbsp;</span>để vận chuyển hàng hóa với số chuyến nhất định.</span></p><p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; color: rgb(200, 50, 43); font-family: &quot;\\\\&quot;roboto\\\\&quot;, helvetica, arial&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\\">Còn dịch vụ<span>&nbsp;</span><strong style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold;\\\">cho thuê xe đầu kéo đi Phú Quốc từ Hà Nội</strong><span>&nbsp;</span>theo thời gian là hợp đồng có thời hạn, thuê theo ngày hay theo tháng. Không có giới hạn thời gian<span>&nbsp;</span><strong style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold;\\\">cho thuê xe đầu kéo đi Phú Quốc từ Hà Nội</strong>. Đặc biệt, với thời gian thuê xe đầu kéo dài hạn hay các đối tác quen thuộc thì thường có nhiều ưu đãi về giá.</span></p><div id=\\\"attachment_3756\\\" class=\\\"wp-caption alignnone\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 5px 20px 20px 0px; background: rgb(247, 247, 247); border: 1px solid rgb(230, 230, 230); max-width: 100%; padding: 10px; text-align: center; color: rgb(200, 50, 43); font-family: &quot;\\\\&quot;roboto\\\\&quot;, helvetica, arial&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; width: 2410px;\\\"><img aria-describedby=\\\"caption-attachment-3756\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" loading=\\\"lazy\\\" class=\\\"size-full wp-image-3756\\\" src=\\\"https://conruabien.vn/wp-content/uploads/2021/10/20191015_123609-daganlogo.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"20191015 123609 daganlogo\\\" width=\\\"2400\\\" height=\\\"1800\\\" srcset=\\\"https://conruabien.vn/wp-content/uploads/2021/10/20191015_123609-daganlogo.jpg 2400w, https://conruabien.vn/wp-content/uploads/2021/10/20191015_123609-daganlogo-768x576.jpg 768w, https://conruabien.vn/wp-content/uploads/2021/10/20191015_123609-daganlogo-1536x1152.jpg 1536w, https://conruabien.vn/wp-content/uploads/2021/10/20191015_123609-daganlogo-2048x1536.jpg 2048w\\\" sizes=\\\"(max-width: 2400px) 100vw, 2400px\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; height: auto; max-width: 100%; border: 0px none; vertical-align: middle; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; width: auto;\\\"><p id=\\\"caption-attachment-3756\\\" class=\\\"wp-caption-text\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; font-size: 11px; line-height: 17px; padding: 5px;\\\">(Hình ảnh Xe đầu kéo vận chuyển sắt thép đi Phú Quốc từ Bình Dương bằng đường bộ, đến Hà 