0, 10, 10); margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 10px; font-size: 30px; text-transform: none; letter-spacing: normal; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; text-align: justify;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\\">Nhà xe 2 chiều nhận gửi hàng từ HCM đi Phú Quốc tọa lạc ngay vị trí thuận tiện</span></h2><p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; color: rgb(200, 50, 43); font-family: &quot;\\\\&quot;roboto\\\\&quot;, helvetica, arial&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; text-align: justify;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\\"><strong style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold;\\\">Nhà xe 2 chiều nhận gửi hàng từ HCM đi Phú Quốc</strong><span>&nbsp;</span>hay bất cứ đâu đều nên đặt tiêu chí vị trí thuận tiện. Theo đó, việc đi lại sẽ dễ dàng hơn và việc vận chuyển hàng hóa ra hay vào nhà xe cũng hạn chế những bất tiện và gây mất thời gian.</span></p><p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; color: rgb(200, 50, 43); font-family: &quot;\\\\&quot;roboto\\\\&quot;, helvetica, arial&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; text-align: justify;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\\">Nhà xe Con Rùa Biển với hơn 15 năm kinh nghiệm hoạt động trong lĩnh vực vận chuyển hàng hóa hiểu rõ điều đó. Và vị trí<span>&nbsp;</span><strong style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold;\\\">Nhà xe 2 chiều nhận gửi hàng từ HCM đi Phú Quốc</strong><span>&nbsp;</span>của Con Rùa Biển không làm các bạn thất vọng.</span></p><p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; color: rgb(200, 50, 43); font-family: &quot;\\\\&quot;roboto\\\\&quot;, helvetica, arial&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; text-align: justify;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\\">Nhà xe Con Rùa Biển tọa lạc tại<span>&nbsp;</span><strong style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold;\\\">14E Quốc Lộ 22, Tân Xuân, Hóc Môn, TP HCM</strong>. Một ví trí thuận tiện cho việc vận chuyển hàng hóa đi bất cứ nơi đâu và ngược lại. Hàng hóa cồng kềnh, siêu trường siêu trọng hay hàng nhỏ lẻ đều dễ dàng vận chuyển đến nhà xe Con Rùa Biển dễ dàng.</span></p><p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; color: rgb(200, 50, 43); font-family: &quot;\\\\&quot;roboto\\\\&quot;, helvetica, arial&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; text-align: justify;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\\">Không gian<span>&nbsp;</span><strong style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold;\\\">Nhà xe 2 chiều nhận gửi hàng từ HCM đi Phú Quốc</strong><span>&nbsp;</span>rộng rãi, bố trí khoa học. Vì thế, các bạn có thể yên tâm là không thất lạc hay hư hỏng hàng hóa.</span></p><div id=\\\"attachment_3856\\\" class=\\\"wp-caption alignnone\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 5px 20px 20px 0px; background: rgb(247, 247, 247); border: 1px solid rgb(230, 230, 230); max-width: 100%; padding: 10px; text-align: center; color: rgb(200, 50, 43); font-family: &quot;\\\\&quot;roboto\\\\&quot;, helvetica, arial&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; width: 2410px;\\\"><img aria-describedby=\\\"caption-attachment-3856\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" loading=\\\"lazy\\\" class=\\\"size-full wp-image-3856\\\" src=\\\"https://conruabien.vn/wp-content/uploads/2021/10/Van-chuyen-da-hoa-cuong-di-Phu-Quoc-64.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"Van chuyen da hoa cuong di Phu Quoc 64\\\" width=\\\"2400\\\" height=\\\"1800\\\" srcset=\\\"https://conruabien.vn/wp-content/uploads/2021/10/Van-chuyen-da-hoa-cuong-di-Phu-Quoc-64.jpg 2400w, https://conruabien.vn/wp-content/upl