\\\" class=\\\"ftwp-heading\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: utm_helveins; font-weight: normal !important; line-height: 1.4; color: rgb(10, 10, 10); margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 10px; font-size: 30px; text-transform: none; letter-spacing: normal; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; text-align: justify;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\\">Gía và các dịch vụ đi kèm của nhà xe 2 chiều nhận gửi hàng nhỏ lẻ đi Phú Quốc như thế nào?</span></h2><p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; color: rgb(200, 50, 43); font-family: &quot;\\\\&quot;roboto\\\\&quot;, helvetica, arial&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; text-align: justify;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\\">Bạn cần làm rõ giá cước của<span>&nbsp;</span><strong style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold;\\\">nhà xe 2 chiều nhận gửi hàng nhỏ lẻ đi Phú Quốc<span>&nbsp;</span></strong>bao giờ, cách tính như thế nào, có bao gồm các dịch vụ ưu đãi khác đi kèm… Sau đó, bạn cần so sánh với giá cước của nhiều<span>&nbsp;</span><strong style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold;\\\">nhà xe 2 chiều nhận gửi hàng nhỏ lẻ đi Phú Quốc<span>&nbsp;</span></strong>khác. Từ đó, bạn có thể đưa ra quyết định nên lựa chọn đơn vị nào tốt nhất, tiết kiệm tối ưu chi phí vận chuyển.</span></p><div id=\\\"attachment_3548\\\" class=\\\"wp-caption alignnone\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 5px 20px 20px 0px; background: rgb(247, 247, 247); border: 1px solid rgb(230, 230, 230); max-width: 100%; padding: 10px; text-align: center; color: rgb(200, 50, 43); font-family: &quot;\\\\&quot;roboto\\\\&quot;, helvetica, arial&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; width: 1930px;\\\"><img aria-describedby=\\\"caption-attachment-3548\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" loading=\\\"lazy\\\" class=\\\"size-full wp-image-3548\\\" src=\\\"https://conruabien.vn/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Van-chuyen-may-bom-di-Phu-Quoc-theo-hinh-thuc-ghep-hang-nho-le-16-scaled.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"Van chuyen may bom di Phu Quoc theo hinh thuc ghep hang nho le 16 scaled\\\" width=\\\"1920\\\" height=\\\"2560\\\" srcset=\\\"https://conruabien.vn/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Van-chuyen-may-bom-di-Phu-Quoc-theo-hinh-thuc-ghep-hang-nho-le-16-scaled.jpg 1920w, https://conruabien.vn/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Van-chuyen-may-bom-di-Phu-Quoc-theo-hinh-thuc-ghep-hang-nho-le-16-768x1024.jpg 768w, https://conruabien.vn/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Van-chuyen-may-bom-di-Phu-Quoc-theo-hinh-thuc-ghep-hang-nho-le-16-1152x1536.jpg 1152w, https://conruabien.vn/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Van-chuyen-may-bom-di-Phu-Quoc-theo-hinh-thuc-ghep-hang-nho-le-16-1536x2048.jpg 1536w\\\" sizes=\\\"(max-width: 1920px) 100vw, 1920px\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; height: auto; max-width: 100%; border: 0px none; vertical-align: middle; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; width: auto;\\\"><p id=\\\"caption-attachment-3548\\\" class=\\\"wp-caption-text\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; font-size: 11px; line-height: 17px; padding: 5px;\\\">(Hình ảnh Nhận gửi hàng máy bơm nhỏ lẻ đi Phú Quốc, nhận chuyển hàng Máy Bơm đi Hà Nội, cho thuê xe chở máy bơm đi Đà Nẵng từ HCM tại Chành xe Hà Nội Sài Gòn Phú Quốc – CON RÙA BIỂN. Trong ảnh là cảnh hàng hóa thiết bị máy bơm đang được vận chuyển đi Phú Quốc theo hình thức ghép xe tải đi Phú Quốc từ Sài Gòn để tiết kiệm chi phí, ngoài ra Nhận ghép xe tải máy bơm đi Bắc Nam cũng rất thường xuyên)</p></div><div id=\\\"attachment_3545\\\" class=\\\"wp-caption alignnone\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 5px 20px 20px 0px; background: rgb(247, 247, 247); border: 1px solid rgb(230, 230, 230); max-width: 100%; padding: 10px; text-align: center; color: rgb(200, 50, 43); font-family: &quot;\\\\&quot;roboto\\\\&quot;, helvetica, arial&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; width: 2410px;\\\"><img aria-describedby=\\\"caption-attachment-3545\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" loading=\\\"lazy\\\" class=\\\"size-full wp-image-3545\\\" src=\\\"https://conruabien.vn/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Van-chuyen-may-bom-di-Phu-Quoc-theo-hinh-thuc-ghep-hang-nho-le-13.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"Van chuyen may bom di Phu Quoc theo hinh thuc ghep hang nho le 13\\\" width=\\\"2400\\\" height=\\\"2400\\\" srcset=\\\"https://conruabien.vn/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Van-chuyen-may-bom-di-Phu-Quoc-theo-hinh-thuc-ghep-hang-nho-le-13.jpg 2400w, https://conruabien.vn/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Van-chuyen-may-bom-di-Phu-Quoc-theo-hinh-thuc-ghep-hang-nho-le-13-768