font-family: &quot;\\\\&quot;roboto\\\\&quot;, helvetica, arial&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; text-align: justify;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\\">Thực tế, nếu bạn so sánh giá cước<span>&nbsp;</span><strong style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold;\\\">Nhà xe 2 chiều Bắc Nam</strong><span>&nbsp;</span>Con Rùa Biển với các đơn vị cung cấp khác sẽ thấy rõ sự khác biệt. Gía cước vận chuyển hàng hóa tại Con Rùa Biển được xem là cạnh tranh nhất thị trường hiện nay.</span></p><p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; color: rgb(200, 50, 43); font-family: &quot;\\\\&quot;roboto\\\\&quot;, helvetica, arial&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; text-align: justify;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\\">Bên cạnh đó, Con Rùa Biển còn có nhiều ưu đãi hấp dẫn đi kèm như bốc dỡ hàng hóa miễn phí tại kho bãi, thu hộ miễn phí, không tính cước đóng gói hay đóng kiện hàng hóa khi khách hàng yêu cầu, lưu kho miễn phí khi hàng hóa cần thời gian chờ vận chuyển, miễn phí giao hàng tận nơi với hàng hóa có trọng lượng lớn cùng dịch vụ miễn phí khi có nhu cầu xuất hóa đơn.</span></p><div id=\\\"attachment_3468\\\" class=\\\"wp-caption alignnone\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 5px 20px 20px 0px; background: rgb(247, 247, 247); border: 1px solid rgb(230, 230, 230); max-width: 100%; padding: 10px; text-align: center; color: rgb(200, 50, 43); font-family: &quot;\\\\&quot;roboto\\\\&quot;, helvetica, arial&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; width: 1810px;\\\"><img aria-describedby=\\\"caption-attachment-3468\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" loading=\\\"lazy\\\" class=\\\"size-full wp-image-3468\\\" src=\\\"https://conruabien.vn/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Du-an-Van-chuyen-Thang-May-di-Phu-Quoc-cua-SunHome-An-thoi-4-scaled.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"Du an Van chuyen Thang May di Phu Quoc cua SunHome An thoi 4 scaled\\\" width=\\\"1800\\\" height=\\\"2560\\\" srcset=\\\"https://conruabien.vn/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Du-an-Van-chuyen-Thang-May-di-Phu-Quoc-cua-SunHome-An-thoi-4-scaled.jpg 1800w, https://conruabien.vn/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Du-an-Van-chuyen-Thang-May-di-Phu-Quoc-cua-SunHome-An-thoi-4-768x1092.jpg 768w, https://conruabien.vn/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Du-an-Van-chuyen-Thang-May-di-Phu-Quoc-cua-SunHome-An-thoi-4-1080x1536.jpg 1080w, https://conruabien.vn/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Du-an-Van-chuyen-Thang-May-di-Phu-Quoc-cua-SunHome-An-thoi-4-1440x2048.jpg 1440w\\\" sizes=\\\"(max-width: 1800px) 100vw, 1800px\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; height: auto; max-width: 100%; border: 0px none; vertical-align: middle; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; width: auto;\\\"><p id=\\\"caption-attachment-3468\\\" class=\\\"wp-caption-text\\\