nh xe Phú Quốc – CON RÙA BIỂN; trong ảnh là cảnh mặt hàng tủ điện đang được xe cẩu di chuyển từ trong kho của khách hàng đưa ra ngoài sân để đưa lên xe tải để vận chuyển)</p></div><div id=\\\"attachment_2600\\\" class=\\\"wp-caption alignnone\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 5px 20px 20px 0px; background: rgb(247, 247, 247); border: 1px solid rgb(230, 230, 230); max-width: 100%; padding: 10px; text-align: center; color: rgb(200, 50, 43); font-family: &quot;\\\\&quot;roboto\\\\&quot;, helvetica, arial&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; width: 2410px;\\\"><img aria-describedby=\\\"caption-attachment-2600\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" loading=\\\"lazy\\\" class=\\\"size-full wp-image-2600\\\" src=\\\"https://conruabien.vn/wp-content/uploads/2021/08/Chia-se-kinh-nghiem-van-chuyen-tu-dien-3.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"Chia se kinh nghiem van chuyen tu dien 3\\\" width=\\\"2400\\\" height=\\\"1800\\\" srcset=\\\"https://conruabien.vn/wp-content/uploads/2021/08/Chia-se-kinh-nghiem-van-chuyen-tu-dien-3.jpg 2400w, https://conruabien.vn/wp-content/uploads/2021/08/Chia-se-kinh-nghiem-van-chuyen-tu-dien-3-768x576.jpg 768w, https://conruabien.vn/wp-content/uploads/2021/08/Chia-se-kinh-nghiem-van-chuyen-tu-dien-3-1536x1152.jpg 1536w, https://conruabien.vn/wp-content/uploads/2021/08/Chia-se-kinh-nghiem-van-chuyen-tu-dien-3-2048x1536.jpg 2048w\\\" sizes=\\\"(max-width: 2400px) 100vw, 2400px\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; height: auto; max-width: 100%; border: 0px none; vertical-align: middle; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; width: auto;\\\"><p id=\\\"caption-attachment-2600\\\" class=\\\"wp-caption-text\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: bo