: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; text-align: justify;\\\"><li style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\\"><strong style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold;\\\">Cho thuê xe cẩu kato tại Phú Quốc</strong><span>&nbsp;</span>theo chuyến.</span></li><li style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\\">Hình thức<span>&nbsp;</span><strong style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold;\\\">cho thuê xe cẩu kato tại Phú Quốc</strong><span>&nbsp;</span>theo ngày.</span></li><li style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\\">Cho thuê xe cẩu kato theo ca.</span></li><li style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\\">Thuê cẩu kato theo trọng lượng hàng cần cẩu.</span></li><li style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\\">Cho thuê xe cẩu kato theo yêu cầu.</span></li><li style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\\">Cho thuê cẩu kato bánh xích.</span></li><li style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\\">Cho thuê cẩu kato bánh lốp.</span></li><li style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\\">Cho thuê cẩu chuyên dụng.</span></li></ul><p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; color: rgb(200, 50, 43); font-family: &quot;\\\\&quot;roboto\\\\&quot;, helvetica, arial&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; text-align: justify;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\\">Bên cạnh đó, còn rất nhiều hình thức<span>&nbsp;</span><strong style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold;\\\">cho thuê xe cẩu kato tại Phú Quốc</strong><span>&nbsp;</span>theo yêu cầu. Vì vậy, tuỳ theo như cầu mà loại hàng hoá các đơn vị công ty vận chuyển sẽ tư vấn cho bạn một giải pháp tốt nhất.</span></p><div id=\\\"attachment_3425\\\" class=\\\"wp-caption alignnone\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 5px 20px 20px 0px; background: rgb(247, 247, 247); border: 1px solid rgb(230, 230, 230); max-width: 100%; padding: 10px; text-align: center; color: rgb(200, 50, 43); font-family: &quot;\\\\&quot;roboto\\\\&quot;, helvetica, arial&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; width: 1450px;\\\"><img aria-describedby=\\\"caption-attachment-3425\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" loading=\\\"lazy\\\" class=\\\"size-full wp-image-3425\\\" src=\\\"https://conruabien.vn/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Van-chuyen-cano-di-Phu-Quoc-7-scaled.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"Van chuyen cano di Phu Quoc 7 scaled\\\" width=\\\"1440\\\" height=\\\"2560\\\" srcset=\\\"https://conruabien.vn/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Van-chuyen-cano-di-Phu-Quoc-7-scaled.jpg 1440w, https://conruabien.vn/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Van-chuyen-cano-di-Phu-Quoc-7-768x1365.jpg 768w, https://conruabien.vn/wp-conten