 initial; width: 2410px;\\\"><img aria-describedby=\\\"caption-attachment-3427\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" loading=\\\"lazy\\\" class=\\\"size-full wp-image-3427\\\" src=\\\"https://conruabien.vn/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Xe-dau-keo-romooc-lun-chuyen-dung-cho-hang-qua-kho-qua-tai.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"Xe dau keo romooc lun chuyen dung cho hang qua kho qua tai\\\" width=\\\"2400\\\" height=\\\"1556\\\" srcset=\\\"https://conruabien.vn/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Xe-dau-keo-romooc-lun-chuyen-dung-cho-hang-qua-kho-qua-tai.jpg 2400w, https://conruabien.vn/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Xe-dau-keo-romooc-lun-chuyen-dung-cho-hang-qua-kho-qua-tai-768x498.jpg 768w, https://conruabien.vn/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Xe-dau-keo-romooc-lun-chuyen-dung-cho-hang-qua-kho-qua-tai-1536x996.jpg 1536w, https://conruabien.vn/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Xe-dau-keo-romooc-lun-chuyen-dung-cho-hang-qua-kho-qua-tai-2048x1328.jpg 2048w\\\" sizes=\\\"(max-width: 2400px) 100vw, 2400px\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; height: auto; max-width: 100%; border: 0px none; vertical-align: middle; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; width: auto;\\\"><p id=\\\"caption-attachment-3427\\\" class=\\\"wp-caption-text\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; font-size: 11px; line-height: 17px; padding: 5px;\\\">Hình Ảnh: Vận chuyển xe cuốc từ HCM đi Phú Quốc bằng xe đầu kéo rơ mooc lùn chuyên dụng chở hàng quá khổ quá tải</p></div><h2 id=\\\"ftoc-heading-4\\\" class=\\\"ftwp-heading\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: utm_helveins; font-weight: normal !important; line-height: 1.4; color: rgb(10, 10, 10); margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 10px; font-size: 30px; text-transform: none; letter-spacing: normal; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; text-align: justify;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\\"><strong style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold;\\\">Tần suất gửi hàng liên tục tại chành xe gửi hàng đi Phú Quốc</strong></span></h2><p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; color: rgb(200, 50, 43); font-family: &quot;\\\\&quot;roboto\\\\&quot;, helvetica, arial&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; text-align: justify;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\\">Vì là hàng ghép nên cứ đủ chuyến là xuất phát. Do đó, thời gian gửi hàng rất linh hoạt, một ngày có nhiều khung giờ. Hầu hết, các bạn không cần phải chờ đợi lâu mà hàng hoá sẽ được vận chuyển nhanh chóng đến Phú Quốc.</span></p><p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; color: rgb(200, 50, 43); font-family: &quot;\\\\&quot;roboto\\\\&quot;, helvetica, arial&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\\">Ngoài ra, đối với những đơn hàng lớn, Quý khách hàng không cần phải đưa hàng ra bãi xe, Con Rùa Biển sẽ hỗ trợ điều xe lấy hàng tận nơi miễn phí cho quý khách hàng yên tâm.</span></p><div id=\\\"attachment_3423\\\" class=\\\"wp-caption alignnone\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 5px 20px 20px 0px; background: rgb(247, 247, 247); border: 1px solid rgb(230, 230, 230); max-width: 100%; padding: 10px; text-align: center; color: rgb(200, 50, 43); font-family: &quot;\\\\&quot;roboto\\\\&quot;, helvetica, arial&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; width: 2410px;\\\"><img aria-describedby=\\\"caption-attachment-3423\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" loading=\\\"lazy\\\" class=\\\"size-full wp-image-3423\\\" src=\\\"https://conruabien.vn/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Van-chuyen-cano-di-Phu-Quoc-5.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"Van chuyen cano di Phu Quoc 5\\\" width=\\\"2400\\\" height=\\\"1800\\\" srcset=\\\"https://conruabien.vn/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Van-chuyen-cano-di-Phu-Quoc-5.jpg 2400w, https://conruabien.vn/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Van-chuyen-cano-di-Phu-Quoc-5-768x576.jpg 768w, https://conruabien.vn/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Van-chuyen-cano-di-Phu-Quoc-5-1536x1152.jpg 1536w, https://conruabien.vn/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Van-chuyen-cano-di-Phu-Quoc-5-2048x1536.jpg 2048w\\\" sizes=\\\"(max-width: 2400px) 100vw, 2400px\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; height: auto; max-width: 100%; border: 0px none; vertical-align: middle; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; width: auto;\\\"><p id=\\\"caption-attachment-3423\\\" class=\\\"wp-caption-text\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; font-size: 11px; line-height: 17px; padding: 5px;\\\">(Hình ảnh Vận chuyển cano đi Phú Quốc từ Sài Gòn, tại Chành xe Phú Quốc – Con Rùa Biển)</p></div><div id=\\\"attachment_3425\\\" class=\\\"wp-caption alignnone