 đá hoa cương, đưa sang xe tải để vận chuyển đá hoa cương đi Phú Quốc bằng xe tải để tiết kiệm chi phí so với vận chuyển đá hoa cương đi Phú Quốc bằng xe đầu kéo container)</p></div><div id=\\\"attachment_3825\\\" class=\\\"wp-caption alignnone\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 5px 20px 20px 0px; background: rgb(247, 247, 247); border: 1px solid rgb(230, 230, 230); max-width: 100%; padding: 10px; text-align: center; color: rgb(200, 50, 43); font-family: &quot;\\\\&quot;roboto\\\\&quot;, helvetica, arial&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; width: 2410px;\\\"><img aria-describedby=\\\"caption-attachment-3825\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" loading=\\\"lazy\\\" class=\\\"size-full wp-image-3825\\\" src=\\\"https://conruabien.vn/wp-content/uploads/2021/10/Van-chuyen-da-hoa-cuong-di-Phu-Quoc-33.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"Van chuyen da hoa cuong di Phu Quoc 33\\\" width=\\\"2400\\\" height=\\\"1350\\\" srcset=\\\"https://conruabien.vn/wp-content/uploads/2021/10/Van-chuyen-da-hoa-cuong-di-Phu-Quoc-33.jpg 2400w, https://conruabien.vn/wp-content/uploads/2021/10/Van-chuyen-da-hoa-cuong-di-Phu-Quoc-33-768x432.jpg 768w, https://conruabien.vn/wp-content/uploads/2021/10/Van-chuyen-da-hoa-cuong-di-Phu-Quoc-33-1536x864.jpg 1536w, https://conruabien.vn/wp-content/uploads/2021/10/Van-chuyen-da-hoa-cuong-di-Phu-Quoc-33-2048x1152.jpg 2048w\\\" sizes=\\\"(max-width: 2400px) 100vw, 2400px\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; height: auto; max-width: 100%; border: 0px none; vertical-align: middle; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; width: auto;\\\"><p id=\\\"caption-attachment-3825\\\" class=\\\"wp-caption-text\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; m