i xe, sẽ được kho Con Rùa Biển rút container đá hoa cương, đưa sang xe tải để vận chuyển đá hoa cương đi Phú Quốc bằng xe tải để tiết kiệm chi phí so với vận chuyển đá hoa cương đi Phú Quốc bằng xe đầu kéo container)</p></div><div id=\\\"attachment_3818\\\" class=\\\"wp-caption alignnone\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 5px 20px 20px 0px; background: rgb(247, 247, 247); border: 1px solid rgb(230, 230, 230); max-width: 100%; padding: 10px; text-align: center; color: rgb(200, 50, 43); font-family: &quot;\\\\&quot;roboto\\\\&quot;, helvetica, arial&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; width: 1930px;\\\"><img aria-describedby=\\\"caption-attachment-3818\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" loading=\\\"lazy\\\" class=\\\"size-full wp-image-3818\\\" src=\\\"https://conruabien.vn/wp-content/uploads/2021/10/Van-chuyen-da-hoa-cuong-di-Phu-Quoc-26-scaled.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"Van chuyen da hoa cuong di Phu Quoc 26 scaled\\\" width=\\\"1920\\\" height=\\\"2560\\\" srcset=\\\"https://conruabien.vn/wp-content/uploads/2021/10/Van-chuyen-da-hoa-cuong-di-Phu-Quoc-26-scaled.jpg 1920w, https://conruabien.vn/wp-content/uploads/2021/10/Van-chuyen-da-hoa-cuong-di-Phu-Quoc-26-768x1024.jpg 768w, https://conruabien.vn/wp-content/uploads/2021/10/Van-chuyen-da-hoa-cuong-di-Phu-Quoc-26-1152x1536.jpg 1152w, https://conruabien.vn/wp-content/uploads/2021/10/Van-chuyen-da-hoa-cuong-di-Phu-Quoc-26-1536x2048.jpg 1536w\\\" sizes=\\\"(max-width: 1920px) 100vw, 1920px\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; height: auto; max-width: 100%; border: 0px none; vertical-align: middle; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; width: auto;\\\"><p id=\\\"caption-attachment-3818\\\