17\\\" class=\\\"wp-caption alignnone\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 5px 20px 20px 0px; background: rgb(247, 247, 247); border: 1px solid rgb(230, 230, 230); max-width: 100%; padding: 10px; text-align: center; color: rgb(200, 50, 43); font-family: &quot;\\\\&quot;roboto\\\\&quot;, helvetica, arial&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; width: 2410px;\\\"><img aria-describedby=\\\"caption-attachment-3117\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" loading=\\\"lazy\\\" class=\\\"size-full wp-image-3117\\\" src=\\\"https://conruabien.vn/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Du-an-Van-chuyen-Sat-thep-di-Phu-Quoc-3.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"Du an Van chuyen Sat thep di Phu Quoc 3\\\" width=\\\"2400\\\" height=\\\"1800\\\" srcset=\\\"https://conruabien.vn/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Du-an-Van-chuyen-Sat-thep-di-Phu-Quoc-3.jpg 2400w, https://conruabien.vn/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Du-an-Van-chuyen-Sat-thep-di-Phu-Quoc-3-768x576.jpg 768w, https://conruabien.vn/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Du-an-Van-chuyen-Sat-thep-di-Phu-Quoc-3-1536x1152.jpg 1536w, https://conruabien.vn/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Du-an-Van-chuyen-Sat-thep-di-Phu-Quoc-3-2048x1536.jpg 2048w\\\" sizes=\\\"(max-width: 2400px) 100vw, 2400px\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; height: auto; max-width: 100%; border: 0px none; vertical-align: middle; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; width: auto;\\\"><p id=\\\"caption-attachment-3117\\\" class=\\\"wp-caption-text\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; font-size: 11px; line-height: 17px; padding: 5px;\\\">Dự án Vận chuyển Sắt thép đi Phú Quốc tại Chành xe Hà Nội – Đà Nẵng – Sài Gòn – Phú Quốc ở CON RÙA BIỂN; trong ảnh là cảnh Xe đầu kéo romooc sàn 12m vừa lấy Bồn chứa công nghiệp xong ở tại Nhà Máy ra ngoài đường để ràng buộc dây, sau đó bắt đầu vận chuyển đi Phú Quốc</p></div><div id=\\\"attachment_3119\\\" class=\\\"wp-caption alignnone\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 5px 20px 20px 0px; background: rgb(247, 247, 247); border: 1px solid rgb(230, 230, 230); max-width: 100%; padding: 10px; text-align: center; color: rgb(200, 50, 43); font-family: &quot;\\\\&quot;roboto\\\\&quot;, helvetica, arial&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; width: 2410px;\\\"><img aria-describedby=\\\"caption-attachment-3119\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" loading=\\\"lazy\\\" class=\\\"size-full wp-image-3119\\\" src=\\\"https://conruabien.vn/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Du-an-Van-chuyen-Sat-thep-di-Phu-Quoc-5.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"Du an Van chuyen Sat thep di Phu Quoc 5\\\" width=\\\"2400\\\" height=\\\"1800\\\" srcset=\\\"https://conruabien.vn/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Du-an-Van-chuyen-Sat-thep-di-Phu-Quoc-5.jpg 2400w, https://conruabien.vn/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Du-an-Van-chuyen-Sat-thep-di-Phu-Quoc-5-768x576.jpg 768w, https://conruabien.vn/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Du-an-Van-chuyen-Sat-thep-di-Phu-Quoc-5-1536x1152.jpg 1536w, https://conruabien.vn/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Du-an-Van-chuyen-Sat-thep-di-Phu-Quoc-5-2048x1536.jpg 2048w\\\" sizes=\\\"(max-width: 2400px) 100vw, 2400px\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; height: auto; max-width: 100%; border: 0px none; vertical-align: middle; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; width: auto;\\\"><p id=\\\"caption-attachment-3119\\\" class=\\\"wp-caption-text\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; font-size: 11px; line-height: 17px; padding: 5px;\\\">Dự án Vận chuyển Sắt thép đi Phú Quốc tại Chành xe Hà Nội – Đà Nẵng – Sài Gòn – Phú Quốc ở CON RÙA BIỂN; trong ảnh là cảnh xe tải chở Bồn chứa công nghiệp, bồn trụ, bồn elip, Bồn khuấy, bồn áp lực, cyclone, Hệ thống xử lý nước thải, hóa chất, Tháp nước, ống khói công nghiệp, thiết bị sấy đang được Cẩu Trục của nhà máy sản xuất đưa hàng sắt thép và thiết bị lên xe tải.</p></div><div id=\\\"attachment_2954\\\" class=\\\"wp-caption alignnone\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 5px 20px 20px 0px; background: rgb(247, 247, 247); border: 1px solid rgb(230, 230, 230); max-width: 100%; padding: 10px; text-align: center; color: rgb(200, 50, 43); font-family: &quot;\\\\&quot;roboto\\\\&quot;, helvetica, arial&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; width: 2410px;\\\"><img aria-describedby=\\\"caption-attachment-2954\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" loading=\\\"lazy\\\" class=\\\"size-full wp-image-2954\\\" src=\\\"https://conruabien.vn/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Van-chuyen-hang-thuc-pham-di-Phu-Quoc-1.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"Van chuyen hang thuc pham di Phu Quoc 1\\\" width=\\\"2400\\\" height=\\\"1800\\\" srcset=\\\"https://conruabien.vn/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Van-chuyen-hang-thuc-pham-di-Phu-Quoc-1.jpg 2400w, https://conruabien.vn/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Van-chuyen-hang-thuc-pham-di-Phu-Quoc-1-768x576.jpg 768w, https://conruabien.vn/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Van-chuyen-hang-thuc-pham-di-Phu-Quoc-1-1536x1152.jpg 1536w, https://conruabien.vn/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Van-chuyen-hang-thuc-pham-di-Phu-Quoc-1-2048x1536.jpg 2048w\\\" sizes=\\\"(max-width: 2400px) 100vw, 2400px\\\" style=\\\"box-s