=\\\"2400\\\" height=\\\"1800\\\" srcset=\\\"https://conruabien.vn/wp-content/uploads/2021/07/Du-an-Van-chuyen-ong-nhua-1-1.jpg 2400w, https://conruabien.vn/wp-content/uploads/2021/07/Du-an-Van-chuyen-ong-nhua-1-1-768x576.jpg 768w, https://conruabien.vn/wp-content/uploads/2021/07/Du-an-Van-chuyen-ong-nhua-1-1-1536x1152.jpg 1536w, https://conruabien.vn/wp-content/uploads/2021/07/Du-an-Van-chuyen-ong-nhua-1-1-2048x1536.jpg 2048w\\\" sizes=\\\"(max-width: 2400px) 100vw, 2400px\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; height: auto; max-width: 100%; border: 0px none; vertical-align: middle; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; width: auto;\\\"><p id=\\\"caption-attachment-2468\\\" class=\\\"wp-caption-text\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; font-size: 11px; line-height: 17px; padding: 5px;\\\">(Ảnh: Dự án Vận chuyển Ống Nhựa – CON RÙA BIỂN – Chành xe Phú Quốc; Trong ảnh là cảnh xe nâng đang đưa ống nhựa ở Chành xe đi ghép xe tải từ Sài Gòn đi Phú Quốc, được xếp lên xe lúc buổi chiều.)</p></div><div id=\\\"attachment_2426\\\" class=\\\"wp-caption alignnone\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 5px 20px 20px 0px; background: rgb(247, 247, 247); border: 1px solid rgb(230, 230, 230); max-width: 100%; padding: 10px; text-align: center; color: rgb(200, 50, 43); font-family: &quot;\\\\&quot;roboto\\\\&quot;, helvetica, arial&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; width: 2410px;\\\"><img aria-describedby=\\\"caption-attachment-2426\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" loading=\\\"lazy\\\" class=\\\"wp-image-2426 size-full\\\" src=\\\"https://conruabien.vn/wp-content/uploads/2021/07/Du-an-Van-chuyen-May-Bien-Ap-47.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"Ch