ansform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; width: 2410px;\\\"><img aria-describedby=\\\"caption-attachment-3421\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" loading=\\\"lazy\\\" class=\\\"size-full wp-image-3421\\\" src=\\\"https://conruabien.vn/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Van-chuyen-cano-di-Phu-Quoc-3.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"Van chuyen cano di Phu Quoc 3\\\" width=\\\"2400\\\" height=\\\"1800\\\" srcset=\\\"https://conruabien.vn/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Van-chuyen-cano-di-Phu-Quoc-3.jpg 2400w, https://conruabien.vn/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Van-chuyen-cano-di-Phu-Quoc-3-768x576.jpg 768w, https://conruabien.vn/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Van-chuyen-cano-di-Phu-Quoc-3-1536x1152.jpg 1536w, https://conruabien.vn/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Van-chuyen-cano-di-Phu-Quoc-3-2048x1536.jpg 2048w\\\" sizes=\\\"(max-width: 2400px) 100vw, 2400px\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; height: auto; max-width: 100%; border: 0px none; vertical-align: middle; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; width: auto;\\\"><p id=\\\"caption-attachment-3421\\\" class=\\\"wp-caption-text\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; font-size: 11px; line-height: 17px; padding: 5px;\\\">(Hình ảnh Vận chuyển cano đi Phú Quốc từ Sài Gòn, tại Chành xe Phú Quốc – Con Rùa Biển)</p></div><div id=\\\"attachment_3374\\\" class=\\\"wp-caption alignnone\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 5px 20px 20px 0px; background: rgb(247, 247, 247); border: 1px solid rgb(230, 230, 230); max-width: 100%; padding: 10px; text-align: center; color: rgb(200, 50, 43); font-family: &quot;\\\\&quot;roboto\\\\&quot;, helvetica, arial&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; width: 2410px;\\\"><img aria-describedby=\\\"caption-attachment-3374\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" loading=\\\"lazy\\\" class=\\\"size-full wp-image-3374\\\" src=\\\"https://conruabien.vn/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Du-an-Van-chuyen-May-Giat-Say-Cong-Nghiep-di-Phu-Quoc-11.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"Du an Van chuyen May Giat Say Cong Nghiep di Phu Quoc 11\\\" width=\\\"2400\\\" height=\\\"1800\\\" srcset=\\\"https://conruabien.vn/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Du-an-Van-chuyen-May-Giat-Say-Cong-Nghiep-di-Phu-Quoc-11.jpg 2400w, https://conruabien.vn/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Du-an-Van-chuyen-May-Giat-Say-Cong-Nghiep-di-Phu-Quoc-11-768x576.jpg 768w, https://conruabien.vn/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Du-an-Van-chuyen-May-Giat-Say-Cong-Nghiep-di-Phu-Quoc-11-1536x1152.jpg 1536w, https://conruabien.vn/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Du-an-Van-chuyen-May-Giat-Say-Cong-Nghiep-di-Phu-Quoc-11-2048x1536.jpg 2048w\\\" sizes=\\\"(max-width: 2400px) 100vw, 2400px\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; height: auto; max-width: 100%; border: 0px none; vertical-align: middle; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; width: auto;\\\"><p id=\\\"caption-attachment-3374\\\" class=\\\"wp-caption-text\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; font-size: 11px; line-height: 17px; padding: 5px;\\\">(Hình ảnh: Dự Án vận chuyển Máy Giặt Sấy Công Nghiệp đi Phú Quốc tại Chành xe Hà Nội Đà Nẵng Sài Gòn Phú Quốc ở cty CON RÙA BIỂN, thuộc Khách sạn Hương Biển cũ ở Dương Đông Phú Quốc; trong ảnh là cảnh đưa những kiện hàng Máy Giặt Sấy Công Nghiệp vào vị trí, trong khu nhà này vào sâu bên trong nên các phương tiện chuyên dụng như xe nâng máy không thể vào, nên dùng sức và tời kéo, con lăn, con đổi để đưa máy vào vị trí, vô cùng khó khăn)</p></div><div id=\\\"attachment_3319\\\" class=\\\"wp-caption alignnone\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 5px 20px 20px 0px; background: rgb(247, 247, 247); border: 1px solid rgb(230, 230, 230); max-width: 100%; padding: 10px; text-align: center; color: rgb(200, 50, 43); font-family: &quot;\\\\&quot;roboto\\\\&quot;, helvetica, arial&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; width: 2410px;\\\"><img aria-describedby=\\\"caption-attachment-3319\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" loading=\\\"lazy\\\" class=\\\"size-full wp-image-3319\\\" src=\\\"https://conruabien.vn/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Cho-thue-xa-lan-cho-xe-dau-keo-container-di-Phu-Quoc-12.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"Cho thue xa lan cho xe dau keo container di Phu Quoc 12\\\" width=\\\"2400\\\" height=\\\"1800\\\" srcset=\\\"https://conruabien.vn/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Cho-thue-xa-lan-cho-xe-dau-keo-container-di-Phu-Quoc-12.jpg 2400w, https://conruabien.vn/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Cho-thue-xa-lan-cho-xe-dau-keo-container-di-Phu-Quoc-12-768x576.jpg 768w, https://conruabien.vn/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Cho-thue-xa-lan-cho-xe-dau-keo-container-di-Phu-Quoc-12-1536x1152.jpg 1536w, https://conruabien.vn/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Cho-thue-xa-lan-cho-xe-dau-keo-container-di-Phu-Quoc-12-2048x1536.jpg 2048w\\\" sizes=\\\"(max-width: 2400px) 100vw, 2400px\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; height: auto; max-width: 100%; border: 0px none; vertical-align: middle; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; width: auto;\\\"><p id=\\\"caption-attachment-3319\\\" class=\\\"wp-caption-text\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; font-size: 11px; line-height: 17px; padding: 5px;\\\">Con Rùa Biển là Chành xe Hà Nội Sài Gòn Phú Quốc chạy chuyên tuyến, có lịch xe chạy cố định hằng ngày, nhận vận chuyển hàng lẻ đi ghép hoặc hàng bao xe. Đặc biệt còn cung cấp dịch vụ vận tải hàng hóa bằng đường thủy theo hình thức: cho thuê xà lan, cho thuê tàu biển, cho thuê phà đi biển, cho thuê xà lan há mòm chở xe tải, xe đầu kéo container từ đất liền đi Đảo Phú Quốc, Đảo Hòn Thơm, Đảo Nam Du, Đảo Thổ Châu, Đảo Hòn Trẻ, Đảo Hòn Sơn.</p></div><div id=\\\"attachment_3321\\\" class=\\\"wp-caption alignnone\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 5px 20px 20px 0px; background: rgb(247, 247, 247); border: 1px solid rgb(230, 230, 230); max-width: 100%; padding: 10px; text-align: center; color: rgb(200, 50, 43); font-family: &quot;\\\\&quot;roboto\\\\&quot;, helvetica, arial&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; width: 1930px;\\\"><img aria-describedby=\\\"caption-attachment-3321\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" loading=\\\"lazy\\\" class=\\\"size-full wp-image-3321\\\" src=\\\"https://conruabien.vn/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Cho-thue-xa-lan-cho-xe-tai-di-Phu-Quoc-2.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"Cho thue xa lan cho xe tai di Phu Quoc 2\\\" width=\\\"1920\\\" height=\\\"1440\\\" srcset=\\\"https://conruabien.vn/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Cho-thue-xa-lan-cho-xe-tai-di-Phu-Quoc-2.jpg 1920w, https://conruabien.vn/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Cho-thue-xa-lan-cho-xe-tai-di-Phu-Quoc-2-768x576.jpg 768w, https://conruabien.vn/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Cho-thue-xa-lan-cho-xe-tai-di-Phu-Quoc-2-1536x1152.jpg 1536w\\\" sizes=\\\"(max-width: 1920px) 100vw, 1920px\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; height: auto; max-width: 100%; border: 0px none; vertical-align: middle; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; width: auto;\\\"><p id=\\\"caption-attachment-3321\\\" class=\\\"wp-caption-text\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: